<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">BYAPIATU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Judges</para>
  <para style="toc2">BYAPIATU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bpt</para>
  <para style="mt1">BYAPIATU</para>
  <para style="mt2">Judges</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Byapiatu hae</char> cikuhpaw ccauh kyahin Israel hae nynh Kanaan ram a law hae ccyh kyate siapharan uknaw atyn ccyh kyacia Israel hae phungpaw kyaze phunglang hoi leite a um ccyh hae kya-e phungpaw kha a zei hae. E ccauh kyahin “byapiatu hae” cikuh hae paw, minphuin kyaze mih rawthung hae paw kong kha zei hae zah, minmin alunghua tuh phung thyhte a cciakhae hae paw byapiatu hae thua leite rhawbawi hae nynh thua hae. Minmin kyaze ccungccaw alunghua nynh a ny hae paw tuh Samson thua zah, a ryalawnaw tuh byaria 13-16 lungkhu kya a um.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh kya ccangpyanaw ale huapaw tuh Israel hae hiinnaw hynh Pachia tungvaw lungzinaw kya nynh a um, mih lungzi khyh ze ronaw a tung hae. Thuasalama tuh-e laeze abyapi huapaw tuh, mih Pachia tungvaw mih lungzi khyh zah ronaw nynh a thuanua hae zemah, minmin nynh ngaesikute amaw kalan bua a maeku hae ze, a ccungccaw hae khum khylan Pachia tuh paccynkute zungzae a um, cipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Joshua a chih cia acyihkuhpaw hae 1.1—2.10</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel byapiatu hae 2.11—16.31</para>
  <para style="io1">Ccangpaw acyihkuhpaw aphuinphuin 17.1—21.25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Adonibezek Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua a chih koute Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Kanaan hae kha tuk khylan kaening hanlan hummou masaty a cceih cih?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Judah nynh a cceih cih. Ram kha a kuih kya ka pya vae,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah nynh a upaw Simeon kha, “Kanaan hae kha tuk khylan ka ccoupaw ram lungkhu lang yn cciakhae; kae nynh mah na ccoupaw ram lungkhu lang kae cciakhae ru cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Simeon nynh a cciakhae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Judah nynh cceih zah Kanaan hae te Periz hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih kuih kya pya hae zah, Bezek khua kya ccungccaw thong haw kha a chia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Bezek khua umpaw Adonibezek kha ccianua hae zah a tuk hae, Kanaan hae te Periz hae kha a tae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Adonibezek tuh a ccue, thuasalama deehuite kyng hae zah a kuihpi te a ccupi kha thoh tya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Adonibezek nynh, “Mih kuihpi te mih ccupi tya athua hae paw siapharan hae sung sari nynh ka ccaboi kaw e loohmoi hae kha leih a khuingku hae; ka la cyi hawte Pachia nynh yn liaru vae,” a ci. Jerusalem lang cciakhae hae zah tuin kya a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Judah hae nynh Jerusalem kha tuk hae zah a law hae, thaloi te bae hae zah maee te a soi hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukoute muaram hae, Negeb te laelung anenaw kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha tuk khylan Judah hae nynh a ccianua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah hae nynh Hebron khua kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha ccianua hae zah, Sheshai, Ahiman te Talmai kha a tae hae (Hebron khua a min tuh langmawlya Kiriath-arba acikuh).</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin kyate Judah hae nynh Debir khuaccaaw hae kha a ccianua hae (Debir khua a min tuh langmawlya Kiriath-sefer acikuh). <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Kaleb nynh, “Kiriath-sefer khua kha tuk zah a lah khopaw tuh ka ccanung kha zu lang ka pya cih,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaleb neitawpaw Kenaz ccapaw Othniel nynh tuh-e khua tuh lah zah, Kaleb nynh a ccanung Aksah kha zu lang a pya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aksah nynh a kya a thua te, Othaniel tuh Aksah nynh a paaw loo ccyng kheit kha ngia lan a naw. Aksah tuh a lann tungvaw te a sahkuh te, Kaleb nynh, “Pawmou na ry?” cite a khia. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aksah nynh, “Lasung ccangkheit beih yn pya; kae hynh Negeb ram kya nae umsah keiccuze Tuisung kha mah beih yn pya,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Kaleb nynh Palung Tuisung te Alia Tuisung kha a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses a pupaw Ken minphuin Hobab ciihan hae tuh Judah hae ryte ungcci ku khua kyate Arad khua pe e Negeb kya umpaw Judah ramkaw langkhe cceih hae zah Amalek hae ryte khua a sahkheih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah tuh a upaw Simeon ryte cceih hae zah Zefath khua kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha tae hae zah, khaleih a ro hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e khua min tuh Hormah a ci hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah nynh Gaza khua te a pepan e ram, Ashkelon khua te a pepan e ram, Ekron khua te a pepan e ram hae kha a law hae. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Judah kha umkhae zah, muaram kha a law kho, thuasalama bialae um hae paw tuh sivaw marangle a hoi hae keiccuze dee kho khyh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses nynh a ho hawte, Hebron kha Kaleb a pya hae; aning nynh Anak ccapaw hae lu thum kha tuin kyate a dee hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Benjamin phin hae nynh Jerusalem kya um hae paw Jebus hae kha dee khyh hae; tukeiccuze Jebu hae tuh Benjamin phin hae ryte Jerusalem kya atunin cia a umkheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Jos 15.63</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:6">2Sa 5.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11:4">1Sh 11.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef ciihan hae nynh mah Bethel kha tuk lan a ccianua hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh minmin kya a um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef ciihan hae nynh Bethel langkhe dophitu hae kha a saw hae (tuh-e khua min tuh langmawlya Luz acikuh). <verse number="24" style="v" />Khua lungkhu te yn cceihpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit kha dophitu hae nynh muih hae zah, “Khua lungkhu lang a teepaw laanpi kha beih oun hopya tua, te na tungvaw thawccinaw kae hoi cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh khua lungkhu lang a teepaw laanpi kha a hopya hae; te minmin nynh khuaccaaw hae kha thaloi te a bae hae, thuasalama tuh-e ccungccapaw te a innbyn hae balyn kha tuh a cciasah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e paw tuh Hit hae ram lang cceih zah khua khuakheit rae zah Luz cite min a phu; atunin cia tuh-e tuh a min nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Manasseh nynh Beth-shean khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Taanak khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Dor khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Ibleam khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw te Megiddo khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw kha dee khyh hae; Kanaan hae tuh tuin ram kya po a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:11-13">Jos 17.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel hae nynh thawzung oun hoi hae tuh, Kanaan hae kha nangsete ryalawsah hae zah dee tuh dee khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Efraim nynh Gezer khua kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha dee khyh hae; Kanaan hae tuh minmin ryte Gezer khua kya a umkheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:10">Jos 16.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun nynh Kitron khuaccaaw hae, Nahalol khuaccaaw hae kha dee khyh hae; Kanaan hae tuh minmin kya umbua hae zah nangsete ryalawsah athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asher nynh Akko khuaccaaw hae, Sidon khuaccaaw hae, Ahlab khuaccaaw hae, Akzip khuaccaaw hae, Helbah khuaccaaw hae, Afik khuaccaaw hae te Rehob khuaccaaw hae kha dee khyh hae; <verse number="32" style="v" />Asher phin hae nynh tuin ram kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha a dee khyh hae keiccuze minmin ryte a umkheih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naftali nynh Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae, Beth-anath khuaccaaw hae kha dee khyh hae, tuin ram kya um hae paw Kanaan hae ryte a umkheih hae; tuhzemah Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae te Beth-anath khuaccaaw hae tuh minmin hanlan nangsete ryalawpahtu lang a tang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amor hae nynh Dan hae kha muaram langkhe dee hae zah, bialae lang rungbung lan kaw-ua khyh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Amor hae tuh Har-heres mua, Aijalon te Shaalbim kya po a um hae, thuasalama Josef ciihan hae tuh thawzung a hoi hae keiccuze minmin tuh nangsete ryalawsahpaw lang a tang hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Amor hae ramri tuh Akrabbim kaethungnaw te Sela kyate palung lang po a kaethung.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Kawngae Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh Gilgal kyate Bokhim lang cceihthung zah, “Izip ram kyate kae cciakhae thung oh zah, nae minpaaw hae kya bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram lungkhu lang kae teekhae oh. ‘Nanning ryte ka raepaw byakinnaw kha papin ka roh lan khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning nynh hynh-e ram kya um hae paw ryte byakinnaw kha rae nan oh; mih silawhang hae kha roh oh,’ ka ci. Thuasalama ka kaw na ngae khyh oh. Na cyi oh paw hynh dotua oh!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-13">Exo 34.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2-5">Deu 7.2-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hopya oh, e ccungccaw hae hynh nae malang kyate ka dee lan khyh hae; minmin tuh nae rhaw hae athua cih hae zah, mih pachia hae tuh nae hanlan kaang athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Israel hae balyn kya hynh-e bya he a ho tuh, ccungccaw hae tuh thawte a rah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Bokhim cite min a phu hae, tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan si a law hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha he a kisah hae te, Israel hae balyn tuh ram kha ccou khylan mih rho laephi raveih langkhe a cceih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua she lungkhu te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hanlan ryalaw lepaw a lawpaw balyn kha a muih hae paw Joshua nukhu e piccan hae she lungkhu balyn tuh Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nun ccapaw Joshua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> seepaw tuh za kheit kum haw acih te a chih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Gaash Mua thahlang, Efraim mua vawlan, Timnath-heres kya umpaw a rho laephi kyakhe a uu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:49-50">Jos 19.49-50</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te tuin she e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih minpaaw hae kyakhe sueluabua athua hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thuasah, Israel hanlan a cyipyapaw rya kha thuasah a nyh leipaw she thawpaw tuh minmin koute yn langkuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Lungzi Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahoy leipaw kha cyih hae zah Baal kha a beik hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih minpaaw hae Pachia, Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a vua hae; mih pepan e ccungccaw hae kya-e ccangpaw pachia hae kha zuite bakhungnua hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinriasah hae. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha vua hae zah Baal te Astartes pachia hae kha a beik hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah, luadetu hae kuih kalan a pya hae, mih pepan umpaw mih rhaw hae kuih kalan a zua hae, tetuh mih rhaw hae kha thadynnua kho vae khyh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh raeringnaw pya hae zah bya a kinpyaku hae hawte, a ccianaw takyh hae kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih nynh phang zokhaw hae zah myaryamaw mih vawsaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh minmin a luadetu hae kuih kyate a luesahtu hae paw byapiatu hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a langsaku hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin nynh mih byapiatu hae bya kha ngaelae khyh hae; ccangpaw pachia hae kyakhe ohhuakuh hae zah a beik hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya a ngae hae paw mih minpaaw hae nynh a zui hae paw laanpi kyate aro mawze ccanglang a cceihsei hae. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin hanlan byapiatu hae kha a langsaku takyh vae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh byapiatu kya um zah, tuh-e byapiatu she balyn kya mih rhaw hae kuih kyate a luesah hae; pawccecize minmin tuh tuaasahtu hae te vawsaw pyatu hae keiccuze a raw a khuinaw hae liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha thawcci hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama byapiatu he a chi vae ze, mimaw mamin lang bua tang hae zah mih minpaaw hae laeze athahhua lante a hiin hae, ccangpaw pachia hae kha beik hae zah a bakhungnua hae. Mih cyisahnaw te mih lungkhungnaw kha ccapyh san vua khyh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel tungvaw Pachia thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah, “E ccungccaw hae nynh mih minpaaw hae kya kaw ka pya hae paw ka byakinnaw kha roh hae zah ka bya a ngae khyh hae keiccuze, <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua he a chih te, a laehy hae paw minphuin hae kya-e phuin kheit sanmah mih malang kyate ka dee lan khyh hae,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih minpaaw hae nynh a zui hae hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kha a zui hae tou zui khyh hae tou cipaw syntawtua nawlan, <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khah-e minphuin hae kha palou dee leite umsah hae zah Joshua kuih kalan pya khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ram kya A laehypaw Minphuin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanaan ram kya rhaw a tuk boi lei hae paw Israel hae balyn kha syntawtua khylan <verse number="2" style="v" />(She takyh kya-e Israel hae nynh rhawtuknaw zia kha a ny nawlan hae kyalya te, langmaw lyaze rhawtuk boi lei hae paw kha rhawtuk ccangpya khylan) <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a laehysah hae paw minphuin hae tuh hynh-e hae hynh nynh athua hae: <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistin siapharan lu pangaw hae, Kanaan hae mih balyn, Sidon hae te Baal-hermon Mua kyate Lebo-hamath mua kyacia Lebanon Mua kya um hae paw Hiv hae nynh athua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kyate mih minpaaw hae kya kaw a la pya hae paw a kawbya hae kha a zui hae tou zui khyh hae tou cipaw ny nawlan, tuh-e hae tuh Israel hae kha syntawtua nawlan nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh Kanaan hae, Hit hae, Amor hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae laku kya um hae zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />mih ccanung hae kha zu lang a dyku hae, mimaw mih ccanung hae kha mah tuh-e hae mih ccapaw hae zu lang a pya hae; mih pachia hae kha a beikbua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Othniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha ningte Baal hae te Asherah hae kha a beik hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel tungvaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah, Mesopotamia siapharan Kushan-rishathaim kalan a zua hae, Israel hae nynh Kushan-rishathaim kha kum tarya rya a lawpya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan he a sia hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae hanlan luesahtu lu kheit kha langsakuh zah, aning nynh a luesah hae, tuh-e paw tuh Kaleb neitaw Kenaz a ccapaw Othniel nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh Othniel tungvaw yn thua zah, aning nynh Israel hae kha bya a pia hae; rhawtuk lan thokuh zah, Mesopotamia siapharan Kushan-rishathaim kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kuih kya a pya, te Kushan-rishathaim kha a tae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ram tuh kum sung pali lungkhu daenaw a um. Te Kenaz ccapaw Othniel tuh a chih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ehud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha bua a rae hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha rawsete Moab siapharan Eglon kha thawzung a hoisah, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eglon nynh Ammon hae te Amalek hae ryte nawccawkheihnaw raete Israel kha ccianua zah a tae; te ungcci ku khua kha a law. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae nynh Moab siapharan Eglon kha kum haw lae tarya rya a lawpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan he a sia hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin hanlan luesahtu lu kheit a sawpya hae, aning tuh Benjamin phin, Gera ccapaw, a voikepaw Ehud nynh thua. Israel hae nynh aning kha Moab siapharan Eglon kalan ngunto kha a thahsah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ehud nynh dong kheit sae zah kyn ning ahepaw thaloi kha raekuh zah, a ranglang phae kya a boeining kaw khe a heedeku. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te ngunto tuh Moab siapharan Eglon kha a pya. Eglon tuh myarya a tho. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ehud nynh ngunto he a pya koute, ngunto a phu hae paw kha a saw hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama amaw tuh Gilgal khua pe umpaw lungbing kalan ki zah, “Pou siapharan, na hanlan byaphi ka hoi,” a cipya. Tetuh siapharan nynh, “Daebabi lan um oh!” cipah hae zah a ryalahtu hae balyn tuh a muihnaw kyate a pou hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te kyaakakinpaw akhaan lungkhu a makhaete a um lyakhe, Ehud nynh naenuakuh zah, “Na hanlan Pachia kyate yn thuapaw bya ka hoi,” cipah zah, siapharan tuh a dahungnaw kyate yn thokuh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh Ehud nynh a voilang kuih kha dyngte a ranglang phae kya-e thaloi kha thuaakuh zah, Eglon vue kha a thuing; <verse number="22" style="v" />thaloi tuh alua ryte po ccong lan tee zah, atho nynh thaloi kha pong a bong, a vue kyate thaloi kha phoh khyh, a-ia phe toikuh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Ehud tuh tee takawnaw akhaan kalan pou zah kyaakakinpaw khaan thuakaw hae kha khaw zah toh te a tousung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ehud he a pou koute ryalahtu hae nynh oun thua hae zah, kyaakakinpaw khaan thuakaw phang toukuhpaw kha a muih hae tuh, “Siapharan hynh kyaakakinpaw akhaan kya a zuin ung hynhsa,” cite a tua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mih ngaemyng cia ngaw hae zah, kyaakakinpaw khaan thuakaw kha a hung khyh keiccuze tohccung lawkuh hae zah a hung hae. Mih bawipaw rhua tuh laekhu kya phang a la huekuh vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhcite a ngaw lya hae khe, Ehud tuh lungbing khunglang zya cceih zah Seirah khua lang po a ccue. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh he a thua te, Efraim mua vaw khe mungkae a tu; Israel hae nynh a nulang te zui hae zah mua vaw te a rungbung hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ehud nynh minmin kha, “Ka nulang yn zui oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae rhaw hae Moab hae kha nae kuih kya ae pya vae oh,” a cipya hae. Tetuh a nulang zuikute rungbung hae zah, Moab hae nynh Jordan vaw a zuanaw hae hmin kha lah hae zah, lu kheit sanmah vaw zuasah khyh hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Moab hae athungpaw te arawhoypaw balyn kha lu kheit san zuasah leite thong haw loukaw a chia hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhcite tuin nin khe Israel kuih kya Moab tuh a shung. Te ram tuh kum sung tarya lungkhu adae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shamgar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ehud koute Anath ccapaw Shamgar tuh yn langkuh, aning nynh Filistin hae za taruh kha ccong ahepaw te a chia hae. Aning nynh mah Israel hae kha a luesah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Deborah te Barak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ehud a chih koute Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha bua a rae hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hazor khua a ukpaw Kanaan siapharan Jabin kuih kya a zua hae; a rhawbawipaw tuh Harosheth-hagoiim kya umpaw Sisera nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bawmnaw ngiakute a sia hae; pawccecize Jabin tuh sivaw marangle za takua hoi zah Israel hae kha kum kuin lungkhu thawte a tuaa a sah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Lappidoth zu, profehnung Deborah tuh Israel hae kya byapiatu lang a tang. <verse number="5" style="v" />Aning tuh Efraim muaram e Ramah khua te Bethel khua laku umpaw Deborah ungcci ku kaw khe leih haung zah, Israel hae tuh byapiaku lan a kalan leih a thua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Naftali ram, Kedesh khua umpaw Abinoam ccapaw Barak tuh Deborah nynh kosah hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh nang kha, ‘La cceih lah, Naftali phin te Zebulun phin kya-e ccungccaw thong haw kha Tabor Mua lang ko hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jabin a rhawbawi lepaw Sisera tuh a marangle hae te a rhawkaw hae ryte Kishon vaw kin khe nang te tungku khylan kae cciakhae cih zah, na kuih kya kae ap cih,’ cite kaw ae pya,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Barak nynh Deborah kha, “Nae cciakhae zetuh ka cceih cih; nae cciakhae khyh zetuh ka cceih lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Deborah nynh, “Kae cciakhae ccaccing cih; thuasalama na laanccia nynh phu-enaw ae ccousah lan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sisera kha nopi kuih kya a zua cih,” a cipya. Te Deborah tuh thokuh zah Barak ryte Kedesh khua lang a cceih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Barak nynh Zebulun te Naftali kha Kadesh lang a ko hae; rhawkaw thong haw nynh a zui hae; Deborah mah amaw kya a cceihbua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ken minphuinpaw Heber tuh Moses a pupaw Hobah ciihan ccangpaw Ken minphuin hae kyate phiakuh zah Kedesh pe, Zaanannim kya umpaw phaesi ku kaw khe bu sakkute a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abinoam ccapaw Barak tuh Tabor Mua lang a kaethung cipaw kha Sisera kya he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="13" style="v" />Sisera nynh a marangle balyn, sivaw marangle za takua te amaw kya um hae paw rhawkaw hae kha Harosheth-hagoiim khua kyate Kishon Vaw kyacia a pum hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Deborah nynh Barak kha, “Thokuh! Atunin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sisera kha na kuih kya ae pya nin nynh thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na malang a cceih ccaccing,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Barak tuh ccungccaw thong haw ryte Tabor Mua kyate a cceihbung hae. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sisera te a marangle hae balyn, a rhawkaw hae balyn kha Barak malang khe mih lung a muasah hae; Sisera tuh a marangle kyate rung zah a ccu te a ccue. <verse number="16" style="v" />Barak nynh marangle hae te rhawkaw hae kha Harosheth-hagoiim kyacia a dee hae. Sisera a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh lu kheit san a laehy lei lan ciate thaloi te a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sisera tuh Ken minphuinpaw Heber zu Jael a bu kyacia a ccu te a ccue; pawccecize Hazor siapharan Jabin te Ken minphuinpaw Heber phin tuh a ccawkuh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Sisera te tungku khylan Jael nynh yn toinuakuh zah, “Rang, ka bawipaw, ka kalan yn cceih, rih nan,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze aning tuh Jael bu lungkhu lang tee zah, Jael nynh boei te a bong. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Sisera nynh Jael kha, “Ka tuihaw zah nia lanpaw tui beihtaraw yn pyabua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Jael nynh vaetua mateitui saving bawng kha hung zah a niasah koute boei te bua a bong. <verse number="20" style="v" />Sisera nynh Jael kha, “Bu thuakaw kya thadyn lah, lukhakheit nynh, ‘E kya ccungccaw a um tou?’ cite ae khia ze, ‘Um khyh,’ na cipah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Sisera tuh a thawbang zah a i lyakhe, Heber zu Jael nynh bu khiadenawpaw ccong te khynlyng kha ccyngkute yccae leite ccianua zah laekhu lang po zua lan a nakalia kha khiade zah phe a chih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Sisera a deehuipaw Barak nynh he yn tee lyakhe, Jael nynh tungku khylan toinuakuh zah, “Rang, na ccungpaw ccungccapaw kha kae muihsah cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Barak tuh Jael bu lungkhu lang a tee; a nakalia kya ccong phang bingkuhpaw, a huekuhpaw Sisera rhua tuh tuin kya a la um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite tuin nin khe Pachia nynh Kanaan siapharan Jabin tuh Israel hae malang khe a biabung. <verse number="24" style="v" />Kanaan siapharan Jabin kha a ro mawlaezung hae, Israel hae kuih tuh houhouh athung.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Deborah Hlaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Deborah te Abinoam ccapaw Barak nynh hlaw a sah hae paw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel hae nynh rhawtuk lan</para>
  <para style="q2">byapaeku hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel hae nynh lungthote</para>
  <para style="q2">mih pyn a pyaku hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pou siapharan hae, thaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pou bawi hae, ngaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha hlaw ka sahpah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q1">roi hoypaw te the ka hoysah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Seir mua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">he na cceih te,</para>
  <para style="q1">Edom ram kyate he na cceih te,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh hy zah</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlang te khuaarah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking nynh khuaa a rawsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae tuh a hy hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">Sinai mua tuh a hy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Exo 19.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Anath ccapaw Shamgar she lya,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jael she lya tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">laanluepi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">daetedae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaccong hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi abypaw kha a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang, Deborah nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel ram kya nung hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">na thoku maw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel ram tuh daetedae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel nynh pachia thawpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he a pokuh hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">koikua hae kya rhawtuk aso.</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel ccungccaw thong sung pali kya</para>
  <para style="q1">khawriaphua thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoi thuasah ccangkheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">muih lan a um zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">lungthote mih pyn a pyakuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel rhawbawi hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinlung a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Arawpaw lann hae</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccikuh hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">amee rupaw boei vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a haung hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi kya a cceih hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">e konglang hynh hotua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui bunaw hmin hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hlawsah hae paw roi,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kyakhe minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> taenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">bua a siakhae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel lungkhu e a khua taraw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">taenaw kha bua a siakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw koikua kalan a cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Thokuh, thokuh, Deborah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Thokuh, thokuh, hlawsahtua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Thoku tua, Barak,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou Abinoam ccapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kyng hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te a laehypaw ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihbung hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thung hae paw kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw hanlan a cceihbung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Efraim kyate accya lang a cceih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Benjamin, nang te</para>
  <para style="q1">na puizia hae kha a zui hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Makhir kyate rhawbawi hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Zebulun kyate rhawbawi hoitang</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccyngkuh hae paw a cceih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Issakhar bawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Deborah ryte oun cceih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Issakhar tuh Barak tungvaw a lungzi;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh accya langkhe</para>
  <para style="q1">Barak nulangte a deekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Reuben phin hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">thawmawte tua lanpaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuuphu hae konawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phyly roi kha thae khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccemou tuuphu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phang na um?</para>
  <para style="q1">Reuben phin hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung phiakunaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gilead tuh Jordan vaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuraw lang a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou Dan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sanphalung hae kya a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">Asher tuh rili kin, a sanphalung hae</para>
  <para style="q2">thadynnaw pe kya</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun tuh a hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pyaku ciate a rawthung;</para>
  <para style="q1">Naftali mah ramkaw ahangnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">chi ciate a rawthungpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Siapharan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw a tuk hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Megiddo tui pe,</para>
  <para style="q1">Taanak khua khe</para>
  <para style="q2">Kanaan siapharan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a tuk hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama phua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">luadete mue khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaawlang te awsi hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tuk hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih laanpi kya ccia lalia te</para>
  <para style="q2">Sisera kha a tuk hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kishon vawpi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a lou hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawrupaw tuithaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">athawsaepaw Kishon.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou ka muisaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawsaenaw te po cciatua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tetuh marang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccukoh te laephi kya suakute</para>
  <para style="q2">roi phe ccae lante a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Meroz kha thyalaw oh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh a ci,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kya um hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccih lante thyalaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawm khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thungpaw kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha bawm khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ken minphuinnung</para>
  <para style="q2">Heber zu Jael tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nopi hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">hythua a ccou huacce nung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bu kya umpaw nopi hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">hythua a ccou huacce nung nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sisera nynh tui ngia zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mateitui kha a pya,</para>
  <para style="q1">bawi banang te</para>
  <para style="q2">samateihaw kha a pya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bu khiadenawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccong kha lawkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ranglang kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalawnawpaw khynlyng kha ccyngte</para>
  <para style="q1">Sisera kha bua zah a lu kha a tude,</para>
  <para style="q2">a nakalia kha po zua lan a thuing.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siseria tuh bakhung zah a khuliakuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jael ccu kya a huekuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jael ccu kya bakhung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a bakhungnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">chih zah a huekuh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Thanlan-aw kyate a do,</para>
  <para style="q2">Sisera a nung nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">zokhawboei kyate do zah:</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Pawccemou a marangle tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">khaw cia yn thua khyh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou a marangle ccu aroi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh aro?’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A haw huapaw a nopi hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a khung hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw toulou nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">byakhungkuh zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Luadepaw uccaw kha muih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a neekuh cciamang hae ngawrei?</para>
  <para style="q1">Rhawkaw miakaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">liaccaw lu kheit tou lu ning tou,</para>
  <para style="q1">Sisera hanlan asi ohkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">luadepaw boeining,</para>
  <para style="q1">haetapaw soikuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">asi ohkuhpaw luadepaw boeining,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka nging kya oiku lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">haetapaw soikuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">asi ohkuhpaw luadepaw boeining</para>
  <para style="q2">zung ning kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a neekuh cciamang hae ngawrei?’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, tuhcite</para>
  <para style="q2">na rhaw hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">marya roh hae sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama na ruiban hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thungnaw te yn thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin hawte thua hae sah,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite hlaw a sah hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">Te ram tuh kum sung pali adae.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Midian hae tungvaw Tuaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Midian kuih kalan kum sari a pya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Midian kuih nynh Israel kha a tae; Midian keiccuze Israel hae tuh mua kyakhe rekunaw hmin, lungkarung te rhawlungrua kha a raeku hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel hae nynh ccacii a tunaw takyh hae kyakhe Midian hae, Amalek hae te nithua lang e ccungccaw hae nynh ccianua hae zah a dou hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh ryahmin tahnuakuh hae zah Gaza khua pepan kyacia laephi kyate apoupaw ccathae kha roh hae zah, Israel ram kya pawpaw mah cciataw khyh hae, tuu, vaetua, lann kha mah cciataw khyh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh mih sahiin hae, mih bu hae kha cciakhae biate tungkhipaw phu zeih alung lante a cceih hae; minmin te mih kalauh hae tuh riatae um khyh hae; tuhcite a tee lalia lan hae te ram tuh a ro hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Israel tuh Midian keiccuze myarya a ryachi zah, Israel hae nynh bawmnaw mue khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midian hae keiccuze Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan he a sia hae tuh, <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh profeh lu kheit kha Israel hae kalan a saw; aning nynh minmin kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Izip ram kyate kae cciakhae thung oh zah seetangnaw inn kyate kae poukhae oh; <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip hae kuih kyate thuasah, nanning ae tuaa ae sah oh paw ccungccaw hae balyn kuih kyate thuasah kae luesah oh, minmin kha nae malang kyate ka dee hae zah mih ram kha kae pya oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />kae nynh nanning kha, ‘Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua; mih ram kya na umnaw oh Amor hae pachia hae kha sawtuanaw na pya lan khyh oh,’ kae cipya oh. Thuasalama ka bya na ngae khyh oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Konaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh yn thua zah, Ofrah khua kya Abiezer minphuinpaw Joash kya-e phaesi ku kaw khe a haung; tuh lyatuin Joash ccapaw Gideon tuh a chanvuih kha Midian hae nynh muih nan hae sah cite misu mianaw khu kya a bua cciamang. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh Gideon kya yn langkuh zah, “Athungpaw te arawhoypaw nang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na kya a um,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideon nynh vaawpaw kha, “Bawihaepaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh kae kya a um lanze, hynh-e hae balyn hynh kae tungvaw kya pawccemou acyiku? ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hynh Izip ram kyate oun cciakhae thung khaw?’ cite kae minpaaw hae nynh oun hopya pathy hae paw ngaeangthua lan umpaw a ryalaw hae balyn kha teimou a um vae? Atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaening hynh oun vua zah Midian hae kuih kya oun ap vae,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kalan hawi zah, “E na thungnaw hynhte cceih lah, Israel kha Midian kuih kyate luesah tua; kae nynh nang kha kae naw,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Gideon nynh, “Bawihaepaw, pawtemou Israel kha ka luesah kho cih? Ka phin tuh Manasseh phin hae kyaze a thawzya huapaw thua zah, kae tuh ka puizia hae kyaze a nyaa huapaw nynh ka thua,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Na kya ka um cih zah Midian hae kha lu kheit cci mawte na theih cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh, “Na malang maehoynaw ka ccou lanze, bya yn hopahpaw hynh namaw nynh na thua cipaw kha ka ny nawlan syntawnaw ccangkhakheit yn langsapyaku tua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kalan kae thua zah, ka lasung kha ccyngpyate na malang ka nung mawlaezung, e kyate la cceih nan hin,” cipah zah aning nynh, “Nae ki mawlaezung ka la um cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gideon tuh a inn lungkhu lang tee zah, miaa taraw sa kheit kha thuasah, vaekhui ephah ccangkheit te raekuhpaw ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha thuasah a paccyn; miaa saw kha shua lungkhu sang zah, miaa ehang kha ang lungkhu lang a sua koute vaawpaw a umnaw phaesi ku kaw langkhe cciakhae zah a pya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia vaawpaw nynh, “Miaa saw te ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha lah lah, e lung vawlan hin nungtua, te miaa ehang kha buthin tua,” a cipya. Te aning nynh tuhcite a cyi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh miaa saw te ransi phing leipaw sanlou kha a kuih te a kyngpaw hoitang dung khate a sua; te lung kyate maee yn rua zah miaa saw te ransi phing leipaw sanlou tuh marya a u; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh a muihnaw kyate phe a zo. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh thua cipaw kha Gideon nynh nyh zah, “Bawipaw PACHIA, yn bawmtua! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kha hawiliakute ka muih vae,” a ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Na kya daenaw um sah; rih nan, na chih lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe Gideon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang kha rae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh daenaw nynh thua, cite min a phu. Tuh-e tuh Abiezer minphuin hae kya-e Ofrah khua kya atunin cia a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Na paaw tangnuapaw, sa ningnaw tangnuapaw kum sari accing vae paw kha sue lah, na paaw kya-e Baal silawhang kha roh, te tuh-e silawhang pe umpaw Asherah thing kha ngetua; <verse number="26" style="v" />e rhawlungrua adung khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia hanlan silawhang kha kou hoy lan raetua; te sa ningnaw tangnuapaw kha na ngepaw Asherah thing khate u lah, maee-ute silawnaw lante raetua,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gideon nynh a ryalahtu hae lu haw kha ko hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopya hawte a cyi; a innbyn te a khuaccaaw hae raw a ri keiccuze tuh-e tuh khuazi khe a cyi.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gideon nynh Baal Silawhang A Ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Awkhua takaw khuaccaaw hae he a tho hae tuh, Baal silawhang tuh phe la roh zah, a pe umpaw Asherah thing tuh phe la pu, te sa ningnaw tangnuapaw tuh a raekuhpaw silawhang kyakhe pya a la thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tetuh “E hynh hummou a cyih?” cite lu kheit te lu kheit a khiaku hae. Akaw-aleih a khia kou hae te, “Joash ccapaw Gideon nynh a cyih,” cite a ho hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh khuaccaaw hae nynh Joash kha, “Na ccapaw tuh chi khylan yn pousah tua, pawccecize Baal silawhang kha roh zah a pe umpaw Asherah thing kha a nge,” a ci hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Joash nynh amaw a rawse hae paw balyn kyakhe, “Baal kha tou na pankhae cih oh? Baal kha na thungkhaw cih oh tou? Baal a pankhaepaw miakaw tuh awkhua ccyh kya chia athua cih. A silawhang tuh ropya athua vae keiccuze aning tuh pachia athua ze, amaw te amaw thungkhawkuh sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuin nin khe Gideon tuh Jerubbaal cite minphu athua, asuilan tuh, Gideon nynh a silawhang kha a ropya keiccuze, “Baal nynh amaw kha dou sah,” cipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tetuh Midian hae, Amalek hae te nithua lang e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh pynkheihlan oun thua hae zah, Jordan vaw kha zuate Jezreel Accya kya ryahmin a tahku hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh Gideon tungvaw yn thua; te mungkae kha tu zah Abiezer phin hae kha a nulang zuiku khylan a ko hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Te locceihtu hae kha Manasseh phin hae ram kya po lekuh lan sawte, minmin kha mah a nulang zuiku khylan a ko hae. Asher, Zebulun te Naftali phin hae ram langkhe mah locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, tuin ram e ccungccaw hae nynh mah minmin ryte tungku khylan oun cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Tuuming te Syntawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gideon nynh Pachia kha, “Na ho vae hawte, Israel hynh ka kuih te na luesah lan athua ze, <verse number="37" style="v" />huimin kyakhe tuuming ka nung cih; tuuming kya kyalya khe dangtui um zah, laephi balyn tuh arou lanze, na ho vae hawte, Israel kha ka kuih te na luesah cih cipaw ka nyh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Te tuhcite acyihkuh. Awkhualan awkhua takaw te tho zah tuuming kha atui he a su tuh, dangtui tuh pakekhupaw kaw kheit acih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh Pachia kha, “Ka tungvaw na thinrianaw tuh maee lang beih rua nan sah, vae kheit kyalya ka ho ung cih; tuuming te vae kheit kyalya syntawnaw raenaw kaw yn pya hin; tuuming kyalya hynh rou sah lah, laephi vawlan balyn tuh dangtui cia sah,” a cipya. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi khe Pachia nynh tuhcite a cyi. Tuuming kyalya tuh rou zah, laephi vawlan balyn tuh dangtui te acia.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gideon nynh Midian hae A Tae hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerubbaal (tuh-e tuh Gideon) te amaw kya um hae paw rhawkaw hae balyn tuh awkhua takaw te thokuh hae zah Harod tuisung pe khe a rya hae; Midian ryahmin tuh minmin te thahlang, Moreh mua aleihpaw accya khe a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Kae nynh Midian hae kha Israel hae kuih kya pya khylan na kya umpaw rhawkaw hae tuh ka hanlan eih lung kaesy hae. Israel nynh, ‘Kamaw kuih nynh kae hynh yn khum,’ cite tuakute kae kha thehoysah leite a umsei cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae kyakhe, ‘A rihpaw te a thinphangpaw miakaw tuh inn lang ki hae sah,’ cite thaesah hae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Gideon nynh minmin kha a syntawtua hae; thong kuin lae ning tuh ki hae zah thong haw alae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:8">Deu 20.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Rhawkaw hae tuh eih alung ung hae; tui kalan cciakhae bung hae lah, tuin kyakhe na hanlan ka syntawtua cih hae. ‘E paw tuh na kya a cceihbua cih,’ ka ci ze, tuh-e paw tuh na kya a cceihbua cih; ‘E paw tuh na kya cceihbua lan khyh,’ ka ci ze, tuh-e paw tuh na kya cceihbua lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gideon nynh minmin kha tui kalan a cciakhae hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Ui nynh tui a lya hawte a lae te tui a lyapaw balyn tuh san kheit kya na nung cih hae; tui nia lan ccukharutung zah a kuih te a neihpaw balyn kha ccangpaw san kheit kya na nung cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuih kya-e tui kha lae te a lyapaw milu tuh za thum acih hae; thuasalama tuhlaepaw hae balyn tuh tui nia lan mih ccukharu a tung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Tui a lyapaw milu za thum khate nanning kha kae khum cih oh zah, Midian hae kha nae kuih kya kae pya cih oh. Tuhlaepaw hae balyn tuh mih inn lang ki hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih banang hae te mih mungkae hae kha a law; te tuhlaepaw Israel hae balyn kha mih umnaw bu kalan Gideon nynh a kisah hae, thuasalama tuh-e za thum kha tuh a umsah hae. Midian ryahmin tuh Gideon a umnaw zakaw accya khe a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Gideon kha, “Thoku tua, mih ryahmin kha tuk ccavae; pawccecize na kuih kya kae pya vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama tuk lan na ri ze na ryalahtu Purah ryte mih ryahmin langkhe cceihbung oh; <verse number="11" style="v" />minmin nynh bya a ho hae paw kha na thae cih oh; tukoute mih ryahmin kha tuk khylan na kuih tuh thawsaesah athua cih,” a cipya. Te Gideon tuh a ryalahtu Purah ryte rhaw hae ryahmin atolang umpaw rhawviabu kalan a cceihbung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Midian hae, Amalek hae te nithua lang e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh tungkhipaw aphu zeih alung lante accya kya a um hae; mih kalauh hae tuh rili kin e laesia hawte riatae um khyh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideon he yn thua tuh, ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh a maan kha a banpaw kya hopah zah, “Maan ccangkheit ka sah, barli sanlou phe kheit tuh Midian hae ryahmin kalan toubung zah, bu kya thua zah bu kha phe pu lan a deih; bu tuh dawleihkuh zah aroh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te a banpaw nynh, “Tuh-e tuh ccangpaw thua leite Israel paw, Joash ccapaw Gideon thaloi nynh thua; Midian te a rhawkaw hae balyn kha Pachia nynh a kuih kya a pya vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e maan te asuilan kong a hoku hae paw kha Gideon nynh he a thae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik; te Israel ryahmin lang ki zah, “Thokuh oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Midian rhawkaw hae kha nae kuih kya ae pya vae oh,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Gideon nynh ccungccaw za thum kha phu thum lang a phia koute, mungkae hae te a lungkhu kya maeekhua umpaw accawnghanpaw banang lepaw hae kha mih kuih raveih kya a pya hae, <verse number="17" style="v" />te minmin kha, “Kae hynh yn dokuh oh lah, ka cyi hawte cyihbua oh; Midian ryahmin kin ka thua te, ka cyi hawte cyihbua oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Kae te ka kya umbua hae paw balyn nynh mungkae he kae tu te, ryahmin po voilu lan um hae paw balyn nynh mah na tubua cih oh zah, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan te Gideon hanlan!’ cite na sia cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gideon te a kya um hae paw za kheit nynh ziraccyng he a thua takaw, rhawviatu rulaeku ccyh khe ryahmin kin kya a thua hae; te mungkae tu hae zah mih kuih kya a ccyng hae paw banang lepaw hae kha a koi hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhcite phu thum hae nynh mungkae tu hae zah banang lepaw hae kha a koi hae, mih voilang kuih te maeekhua kha kyng hae zah mih ranglang kuih te tu lanpaw mungkae kha a kyng hae; te, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan te Gideon hanlan thaloi!” cite a sia hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh ryahmin po voilu lan mimaw hmin kyakhe thadyn hae zah ryahmin kya-e ccungccaw hae balyn tuh a ccue hae; sia hae zah a ccue vae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh mungkae za thum kha he a tu hae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rhawkaw miakaw tuh mimaw mih ban hae kha thaloi te baesah hae zah, rhawkaw hae tuh Zererah langsang Beth-shittah kyacia, Tabbath khua pe Abelmeholah ramri kyacia a ccue hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Naftali phin, Asher phin te Manasseh phin mih balyn kya-e Israel ccungccaw hae kha ko hae zah Midian hae tuh a deehui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh locceihtu hae kha Efraim muaram hae balyn kya po lekuh lan saw hae zah, “Midian hae kha dou khylan oun cceihbung oh, Beth-barah khua kyacia vaw taraw hae kyakhe thuasah, Jordan vaw kyakhe thuasah la cciakhaw oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Efraim pise balyn kha ko hae zah, minmin nynh Beth-barah khua kyacia vaw taraw hae kyakhe thuasah, Jordan vaw kyakhe thuasah a cciakhaw hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Midian rhawbawi lu ning Oreb te Zeeb kha a kyng hae; Midian hae kha a dee lalia lan hae te Oreb kha Oreb lungpi kya theih hae zah Zeeb kha Zeeb misu mianaw khu kya a chia hae. Oreb lu te Zeeb lu kha Gideon kalan Jordan vaw khuraw lang a phu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gideon A Taenaw te Phulawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim phin hae nynh Gideon kha, “Midian hae dou khylan na ccia lyaze pawccemou kaening nae kobua khyh? Kae tungvaw na rynaw hynh pawmou athua?” cite ci hae zah thawte a seisah hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh minmin kha, “Na cyi oh paw te touseku lanze ka cyipaw hynh paw san athua zawtou? Efraim misu ccamua tuh Abiezer misu thae lopaw laeze hoyhua khyh tou? <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia nynh Midian rhawbawi hae Oreb te Zeeb kha nae kuih kya ae pya vae oh; na cyi oh paw te touse lanze kae tuh pawmou ka cyi kho?” a cipya hae. E bya he a ho te, mih thinrianaw tuh adae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.3-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:11">Sam 83.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Gideon te a kya um hae paw za thum tuh Jordan vaw thua hae zah a zua hae, thawbangte rhaw hae kha a deehui hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gideon nynh Sukkoth khuaccaaw hae kha, “Thawccinawte kae yn zui hae paw hynh sanlou beih pya oh, pawccecize mih thawbang vae, kae tuh Midian siapharan hae Zebah te Zalmunna kha ka deehui cciamang hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Sukkoth khua e bawi hae nynh, “Kaening nynh na rhawkaw hae kha sanlou kae pya lan hae paw tuh, Zebah te Zalmunna tuh na kuih kya a thua vae hae zawtou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Gideon nynh khung hae zah, “Ahoy, Zebah te Zalmunna kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kuih kya he yn pya te, nae ngesaw kha ramkaw e hinpaw te thabu kya kae syde cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin kyate Penuel khua lang cceihthung zah minmin kha tuhmaminte a ngia hae; Penuel khuaccaaw hae nynh Sukkoth khuaccaaw hae hawte bya a khung hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh Penuel khuaccaaw hae kha, “Taenaw te he kae ki te, e innhangpaw hynh ka tingsah cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebah te Zalmunna tuh mih rhawkaw hae ryte Karkor khua kya a um hae, thong haw lae pangaw loukaw a um hae, tuh-e hae balyn tuh nithua lang e ccungccaw hae mih rhawkaw hae balyn kya-e a laehy hae paw nynh thua hae; zunghe kyngpaw ccungccaw cciing kheit thong kuin a chih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Gideon tuh Nobah te Jogbehah nithua lang, khuaccongnaw laanpi khate cceihthung zah, rhaw hae kha a tuk hae; pawccecize rhaw hae tuh rhawviaku leite a la um hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Zebah te Zalmunna tuh a ccue hae; Gideon nynh deehui hae zah Midian siapharan lu ning Zebah te Zalmunna kha a kyng hae, mih rhawkaw hae balyn kha a siisaku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joash ccapaw Gideon tuh rhawtuknaw kyate Heres mua kaethungnaw kyakhate a ki lyakhe, <verse number="14" style="v" />Sukkoth khuapaw ccangvaepaw lu kheit kha kyng zah bya a khia; tuh-e paw nynh Sukkoth khua e bawi hae te piccan hae sung sari lu sari min kha a zeipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Gideon tuh Sukkoth khuaccaaw hae kalan yn cceih zah, “ ‘Kaening nynh na rhawkaw hae kha sanlou kae pya lan hae paw tuh, Zebah te Zalmunna tuh na kuih kya a thua vae hae zawtou?’ cite nanning nynh mih konglang nae hopya oh paw Zebah te Zalmunna tuh hein kya a um hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh khua kya-e piccan hae kha ko hae zah ramkaw e hinpaw te thabu khate Sukkoth khuaccaaw hae kha a syde hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Penuel khua e innhangpaw kha mah tingsah zah khuaccaaw hae kha a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh Zebah te Zalmunna kha, “Tabor khua kya na chia hae paw kha teimou a um hae?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Mih balyn mawte namaw hawte nynh athua hae; siapharan ccapaw hae nynh a lo hae,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh, “Minmin tuh ka uno hae thua hae zah ka nung ccapaw hae nynh athua hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, mih hiinnaw kha na la haang oh zetuh, nanning kha kae theih lan khyh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh a ccatawccaw Jether kha, “Thokuh lah theih hae!” a cipya. Thuasalama aning tuh ccangvae taraw athua ung keiccuze rih zah a thaloi kha thuaakuh khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Zebah te Zalmunna nynh, “Namaw ccaccei nynh yn cceih lah oun theih; pawccecize ccungccaw tuh piccan athua thyhawte a thawzung mah athuabua,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Gideon nynh Zebah te Zalmunna kha theih hae zah, mih kalauh hae nging kya a ccaannaw hae paw uccaw hae kha a law.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gideon kya-e Zohtuh Beiknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae nynh Gideon kha, “Nang nynh kaening hynh oun uk, namaw, na ccapaw te na mintaw nynh mah oun uk hae sah; pawccecize Midian kuih kyate kaening kha nae luesah vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Gideon nynh minmin kha, “Kae nynh kae uk lan khyh oh, ka ccapaw nynh mah ae uk lan khyh oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae uk cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Gideon nynh minmin kha, “Uccaw ccangkheit ngia kae ry oh; luadete na lawku oh paw nakuahuing kha bebe yn pya oh,” a cipya hae. (Pawccecize rhaw hae tuh Ishmael phin thua hae zah sui nakuahuing a hoi hae.) <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Lungthote kae pya cih,” a ci hae. Te boei kha phae hae zah, a luade hae paw nakuahuing hae kha mih balynte boei vawlan a nung hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Gideon nynh a ngia hae paw sui nakuahuing tuh sui shekel thong kheit za sari ari (ccaankunawpaw uccaw, si alungmung, Midian siapharan hae nynh a lawku hae paw sephaphuhpaw boeining hae te mih kalauh hae nging kya a ccaannaw hae paw uccaw hae hobia leite). <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuhte Gideon nynh ranpibawi angki zung kheit rae zah amaw khua, Ofrah khua kya a nung; Israel hae balyn nynh tuin kyakhe ohhuakuh hae zah, tuh-e tuh Gideon te a innbyn hanlan kaang lang a tang. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhcite Midian tuh Israel hae nynh tae hae zah, mih lu hang vae khyh hae. Tuhcite ram tuh Gideon she kya kum sung pali lungkhu adae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joash ccapaw Jerubbaal tuh amaw inn lang cceih zah a um. <verse number="30" style="v" />Gideon tuh zu patae hoi zah a ciihan, ccapaw sung sari a saah. <verse number="31" style="v" />Shekhem khua kya umpaw a lovaenung nynh mah ccapaw lu kheit saahpah zah, Abimelek cite min a phu. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te Joash ccapaw Gideon tuh myarya a taw te a chih, Abiezer hae khua Ofrah khua umpaw a paaw Joash shawku kya a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gideon he a chih takaw te, Israel hae tuh mimaw mamin lang tang hae zah, Baal pachia khate ohhuakute Baal-berith kha mih pachia lang a raeku hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Mih pepan po voilu lan um hae paw mih rhaw hae balyn kuih kyate a luesah hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha tuathui vae khyh hae; <verse number="35" style="v" />te Gideon nynh Israel hanlan a la cyipaw hoynaw balyn hanlan liarute, Jerubbaal (tuh-e tuh Gideon nynh thua) innbyn tungvaw kya lungzinaw langsakuh vae khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerubbaal ccapaw Abimelek tuh Shekhem khua e a nung puizia hae kalan cceih zah, minmin te a nung puizia hae balyn kyakhe, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Shekhem khua e uktu hae balyn nynh a thaenaw hae kyakhe, ‘Nae hanlan pawmou ahoyhua, Jerubbaal ccapaw hae sung sari nynh mih balynte ae uk oh paw tou, tuhkhyhze lu kheit nynh ae uk oh paw tou?’ cite la khiatua oh. Kae tuh nae ru te nae saw ka thuapaw hynh mah la ning nan oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e bya balyn tuh a nung puizia hae nynh Shekhem khua e uktu hae a thaenaw hae khe Abimelek ccelang a hopya hae; minmin tuh Abimelek nulang zuiku rynaw thinlung a hoi hae, pawccecize minmin nynh, “Abimelek tuh aening uno nynh thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh Baal-berith inn lungkhu e ngunphua sung sari kha a pya hae, tuh-e ngunphua tuhte Abimelek nynh a nulang a zuikuh lanpaw ccungccaw, ccungkia leipaw te a hynhu hae paw kha a hoh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ofrah khua umpaw a paaw inn lang cceih zah, Jerubbaal ccapaw hae, a uno hae sung sari kha lungpi ccangkheit vawlan khe a chia hae; thuasalama Jerubbaal a ccasoipaw Jotham tuh zya rekuh zah a hiinhy. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Shekhem khua e uktu hae balyn te Beth-millo khuaccaaw hae balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah, Shekhem khua e liathuinawpaw phaesi ku pe khe Abimelek kha siapharan lang a khang hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thingku hae Tousenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e konglang tuh Jotham kha he a hopah hae tuh, Gerizim Mua dung lang kae zah a thadyn, te thawte sia zah minmin kha, “Shekhem uktu hae, Pachia nynh nae bya ae ngaepya nawlan oh, ka bya hynh ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vae kheit tuh thingku hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih siapharan lang</para>
  <para style="q1">chitui thuh khylan cceih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">oliv ku kha, ‘Kaening hynh oun uk,’</para>
  <para style="q2">a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oliv ku nynh minmin kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ccungccaw hae te pachia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtuanaw pyanawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tho hoypaw hynh cciatawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">thingku hae kha uk khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cceih cih aa tou?’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te thingku hae nynh thaeku ku kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Nang nynh yn cceih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening hynh oun uk,’ a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama thaeku ku nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ka enaw te athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thae kha nungsyate,</para>
  <para style="q3">thingku hae kha uk khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cceih cih aa tou?’</para>
  <para style="q3">a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te thingku hae nynh misu ku kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Nang nynh yn cceih lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening hynh oun uk,’ a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama misu ku nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ccungccaw hae te pachia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q3">mih lungtuasahpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka misutui kha cciatawte</para>
  <para style="q3">thingku hae kha uk khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cceih cih aa tou?’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thingku hae</para>
  <para style="q2">balyn nynh hinpawbu kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Nang nynh yn cceih lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening hynh oun uk,’ a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinpawbu nynh thingku hae kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Nanning nynh siapharan lang</para>
  <para style="q1">khang khylan thanccingte</para>
  <para style="q2">chitui nae thuh oh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mynlyh kaw kya um oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama tuhcite</para>
  <para style="q1">athua khyh zetuh, hinpawbu kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">maee yn pou sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Lebanon kya-e sidar thing hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">u hae sah,’ a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze Abimelek kha siapharan lang khangkute nanning nynh lungzi sawtuate na um oh ze thuasah, Jerubbaal te a puizia hae kha hoyte na ccuepe oh zah, a ryalaw mee thyhte na liaru oh ze thuasah, <verse number="17" style="v" />ka paaw nynh nae hanlan rhaw ae tukpah oh zah, a hiinnaw pyakute Midian hae kuih kyate ae luesah oh; <verse number="18" style="v" />thuasalama atunin nanning nynh ka paaw puizia hae kha na dou oh zah, a ccapaw hae sung sari kha lungpi ccangkheit vawlan na chia oh; te a seenung ccapaw Abimelek tuh nae puizia athua keiccuze Shekhem khuaccaaw hae kya siapharan lang na nung oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Atunin nanning nynh Jerubbaal te a puizia hae kya lungzi sawtuate na um oh ze, Abimelek tungvaw nae lungtua sah lah, aning nynh mah nae tungvaw a lungtua sah; <verse number="20" style="v" />thuasalama tuhte athua khyh zetuh, Abimelek kyate maee pou sah lah, Shekhem te Beth-millo khuaccaaw hae kha u hae sah; te Shekhem te Beth-millo khuaccaaw hae kyate mah maee pou sah lah, Abimelek kha u sah,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Jotham tuh a uno Abimelek raw a ri keiccuze ccue zah, Beer khua lang cceih zah tuin kya a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Abimelek Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abimelek nynh Israel kha kum thum a uk. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia nynh Abimelek te Shekhem khuaccaaw hae laku kya muisaw hoyleipaw kha sawnua hae zah, Shekhem khuaccaaw hae nynh Abimelek tungvaw mih lungzi vae khyh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuhte acyikupaw tuh, Jerubbaal ccapaw hae sung sari kha puathote theih hae zah, tuh-e hae chiise tuh a theihtupaw mih uno Abimelek tungvaw thuasah, a uno hae chia khylan thawzung a pya hae paw Shekhem khuaccaaw hae tungvaw thuasah accaw keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimelek kha buh khylan Shekhem khuaccaaw hae nynh mua dung hae kyakhe ccungccaw nung hae zah, tuh-e hae nynh tuh-e laanpi kya a cceihpaw balyn kha uccaw a luade hae; tuh-e konglang tuh Abimelek kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ebed ccapaw Gaal nynh a puizia hae ryte Shekhem khua lang nuekuh zah, Shekhem khuaccaaw hae nynh amaw kha a doliaku hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Loo lang cceih hae zah mih misu khokhu kya-e misu thae kha pumte su hae zah, poi a tua hae. Mih pachia inn lungkhu lang teete ae hae neih hae zah, Abimelek kha a sarya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebed ccapaw Gaal nynh, “Kaening Shekhem khuaccaaw hae tuh ahum kae thua zah, Abimelek tuh ahum athua keiccu mou rya kae lawpya lanpaw tuh? Jerubbaal ccapaw te a kuihkaw e bawi Zebul nynh Shekhem paaw Hamor a ccungccaw hae kha ryalawpah khyh hae tou? Pawccemou kaening nynh Abimelek kha rya kae lawpya lanpaw tuh? <verse number="29" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae hynh ka kuihkaw um hae ravo nyn! Tuhte a la thua ze, Abimelek kha ccaring ka dee cih zah, ‘Na rhawkaw hae kha lungsah chih hae lah, yn pou,’ ka ci cih paw,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ebed ccapaw Gaal bya kha Shekhem khua uktu Zebul nynh a thae te, a thinrianaw tuh maee lang arua. <verse number="31" style="v" />Aning nynh Abimelek kalan, Arumah langkhe ccungccaw saw zah, “Dotua, Ebed ccapaw Gaal te a puizia hae nynh Shekhem lang oun cceih hae zah, nang kha dou khylan khuaccaaw hae kha a tuhou hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang te na umkheih oh paw rhawkaw hae nynh khuazi khe cceih oh lah, loo kyakhe buh oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Awkhua takaw, khuanin thua takaw te, thokuh oh lah, khua kha thiing oh; aning te a umkheih hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh nanning dou khylan he oun pou hae te, na cyi kho thyh oh te na cyih cih oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abimelek te a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh khuazi khe thokuh hae zah, phu pali lang phiakute Shekhem khua kha a buh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Ebed ccapaw Gaal tuh toikuh zah khua koikua teenaw kya he a thadyn te, Abimelek te a umkheih hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh a buhnaw hae kyate a thonuaku hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Gaal nynh minmin kha he a muih hae te, Zebul kha, “Dotua, mua dung hae kyate ccungccaw hae oun rungbung hae!” a cipya. Te Zebul nynh, “Mua a mynlyh kha nynh ccungccaw hae lang na ria,” a cipya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Gaal nynh bua hopah zah, “Dotua, ram angaelung kyate ccungccaw hae oun rungbung hae, phu kheit tuh Beidinhothya hae paw kya-e Phaesi ku kalan te oun cceih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Te Zebul nynh amaw kha, “ ‘Kaening nynh rya kae lawpya lanpaw Abimelek tuh hummou athua?’ cite na hopaw na bya kha atu teimou a um vae. E ccungccaw hae hynh pawlang na ria lei hae paw kha thua khyh hae tou? Atu toikuh lah, tuktua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gaal tuh Shekhem khuaccaaw hae malang khe toikuh zah Abimelek te rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Abimelek nynh dee zah a malang khe Gaal tuh a ccue; koikua teenaw kyacia ccungccaw patae vaemaw muete a khuliakuh hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Te Abimelek tuh Arumah kya a um; Zebul nynh Gaal te a puizia hae kha Shekhem khua kya a um khyh nawlan hae ccaring a dee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Awkhualan khe ccungccaw hae tuh loo lang a cceih hae. Tuh-e konglang tuh Abimelek he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="43" style="v" />a rhawkaw hae kha ko hae zah, phu thum lang phiate loo kya a buh hae. Khua kyate oun toikuh hae paw kha do zah he a muih hae tuh, thonuakuh hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Abimelek te a umkheih hae paw aphu nynh malang naang hae zah khua koikua teenaw kyakhe a thadyn hae, tuh ccyh lyakhe phu ning hae nynh loo kya umpaw balyn kha naang hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Abimelek nynh khuapi kha anin ninlang tuk zah a lah koute khua kya umpaw balyn kha a chia hae, khua kha khaleih roh zah loi a phing.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Shekhem Innhangpaw kya um hae paw balyn nynh tuh-e konglang tuh he a thae hae te, El-berith beikinn rhawlungrua lungkhu lang a tee hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Shekhem Innhangpaw kya um hae paw balyn tuh a sueluakuh hae cite Abimelek kha a hopya hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abimelek tuh a umkheih hae paw rhawkaw hae balyn ryte Zalmon Mua lang a kae hae. Abimelek nynh hae zung kheit ccyngkute thingran ran kheit kha bae zah, a raw kya a khangku. Te aning nynh rhawkaw hae kha, “Ka cyipaw na muih oh thyhte arangte cyih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rhawkaw miakaw nynh thingran kha ccarou baekuh hae zah Abimelek nulang zuikute khualungrua kha a pumnua hae, te khualungrua kha maee te soi hae zah, Shekhem Innhangpaw kya-e ccungccaw balyn, nopi pise thong kheit loukaw a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Te Abimelek tuh Thebez khua lang cceih zah, Thebez kha ryahmin tahnuakute a law. <verse number="51" style="v" />Thuasalama khuapi lungkhu kya sihkakinpaw innhangpaw ccangkheit a um, khua kya um hae paw nopi pise balyn tuh tuh-e innhangpaw kalan ccue hae zah a khawsungkuh hae; innhangpaw innccuvaw lang a kae hae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Abimelek nynh tuh-e innhangpaw kha ccianuate tuk zah, maee te u khylan tuh-e innhangpaw teenaw kalan khe a naekuh. <verse number="53" style="v" />Nopinung lu kheit nynh sungmia-lung te Abimelek lu kha sawphu zah, a luru akoi. <verse number="54" style="v" />Tetuh a rhawtuk-uccaw a ccyngpahpaw ccangvaepaw kha ko kangmaw zah, “Na thaloi kha thuaakuh lah, yn theih; tuhteze nynh ccungccaw hae nynh, ‘Nopinung nynh aning kha a theih,’ cite yn ho lan khyh hae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze ccangvaepaw nynh po zua lan thuing zah Abimelek tuh a chih. <verse number="55" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Abimelek a chipaw kha a thae hae tuh, mimaw inn raveih lang a ki hae. <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuhcite a uno sung sari kha theih zah a paaw tungvaw seinaw a rae keiccuze Pachia nynh Abimelek kha a liaru; <verse number="57" style="v" />te Shekhem khuaccaaw hae hoyleinaw balyn kha mimaw lu vawlan Pachia nynh ccawsah zah, Jerubbaal ccapaw Jotham thyalawnaw tuh mih tungvaw accah.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tola te Jair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abimelek koute Issakhar phin, Dodo ccapaw Puah a ccapaw Tola tuh Israel hae luesah khylan yn langkuh, aning tuh Efraim muaram, Shamir khua kya a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning tuh Israel hae kya kum kuin lae thum cia byapiatu lang a tang. Te aning tuh chih zah Shamir khua kya a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tola koute Gilead phin Jair tuh yn langkuh zah, Israel hae kya kum kuin lae ning cia byapiatu lang a tang. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning tuh lann sung thum a ccikuh hae paw ccapaw sung thum a hoi; minmin tuh Gilead ram kya khua sung thum hoi hae zah, atunin cia Havvoth-jair cite ko athua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jair tuh chih zah Kamon khua kya a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ammon hae nynh Tuaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe hoyleinaw kha bua rae hae zah, Baal te Astartes pachia hae, Aram pachia hae, Sidon pachia hae, Moab pachia hae, Ammon hae pachia hae, Filistin hae pachia hae kha a beik hae. Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha vua hae zah amaw kha beik khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Israel tungvaw myarya a thinria zah, Filistin hae kuih te Ammon hae kuih kalan a zua hae, <verse number="8" style="v" />minmin nynh Israel hae kha tuh-e kum kya reih hae zah a tuaa a sah hae. Jordan khuraw lang Gilead ram kya umpaw Amor ram e Israel hae balyn kha kum haw lae tarya lungkhu a tuaa a sah hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ammon hae nynh mah Judah, Benjamin te Efraim ciihan hae kha dou khylan Jordan vaw a zua hae; tukeiccuze Israel tuh myarya vawsawte a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia hae zah, “Kaening nynh na tungvaw kae sei vae, pawccecize kae Pachia kha kae vua zah Baal pachia hae kha kae beik vae,” a ci hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae kha, “Izip hae, Amor hae te Filistin hae kyate nanning kha kae luesah khyh oh tou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon hae, Amalek hae te Maon hae nynh nanning kha ae tuaa ae sah oh; te ka kalan nae sia oh zah mih kuih kyate kae luesah oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhzemah kae kha nae vua oh zah ccangpaw pachia hae kha na beik oh; tukeiccuze kae luesah vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Cceih oh lah, na poku oh paw pachia hae kalan khe sia oh; nae vawsaw lyakhe tuh-e hae nynh ae luesah oh sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Kae sei vae; ahoy na ci hawte kae tungvaw oun cyih; thuasalama atunin beih oun luesah!” a ci hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh ramccang pachia hae kha mih kyate vua hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae; te Israel hae teingnaw a muih tuh a lunghoy khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Ammon hae tuh zunghe ccyngku lan suelua thua hae zah, Gilead ram kya a rya hae; Israel hae tuh sueluakuh hae zah Mizpah khua kya a rya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Gilead ccungccaw hae rhawbawi hae nynh, “Ammon hae khuh hum nynh mou a tuk ty cih hae? Tuh-e paw tuh Gilead ram um hae paw balyn kyaze lupi athua cih,” a ciku hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jefthah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead minphuin Jefthah cikuhpaw ohhuanung ccapaw tuh a rawthungpaw rhawkaw nynh thua. Gilead tuh Jefthah a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Gilead zu nynh mah ccapaw hae kha a saahpya; a zu ccapaw hae he oun le hae tuh, Jefthah kha ccaring dee hae zah, “Kae paaw inn kya-e rho ccapyh san na ccoubua lan khyh; pawccecize nang tuh nung ccangpaw ccaaw nynh na thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh Jefthah tuh a neitaw hae kyate ccue zah Tob ram kya a um. Ccungkia lei hae paw tuh Jefthah kya sueluakuh hae zah a nulang a zuikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh koute Ammon hae nynh Israel hae kha rhawtuk hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammon hae nynh Israel hae kha rhaw he a tuk hae tuh, Gilead piccan hae tuh Jefthah kha Tob ram kyate ko khylan a cceih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh Jefthah kha, “Ammon hae kha tuk khylan yn cceih lah, kae rhawbawi lang oun tangpah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Jefthah nynh Gilead piccan hae kha, “Nanning tuh kae nae vua oh paw te ka paaw inn kyate nae dee oh paw na thua khyh oh tou? Atu vawsaw na tung oh te, pawccemou ka kalan nae ccia oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead piccan hae nynh Jefthah kha, “Tukeiccu latu, atu na kalan kae maeleihku, kae kya cceihbua lah, Ammon hae kha dou lan hae, te Gilead ram kae umpaw balyn kya lu lang na tang cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jefthah nynh Gilead piccan hae kha, “Ammon hae tuk khylan inn lang nae kikhae oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha ka kuih kya yn pya ze, kae tuh nae lu lang ka tang cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Gilead piccan hae nynh Jefthah kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening laku kya ccaekia athua cih; na ho hawte solei kae cyih cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jefthah tuh Gilead piccan hae ryte cceih hae zah, ccungccaw hae nynh lupi lang te cciakhaetu lang a nungku hae; te Jefthah nynh tuh-e a bya balyn tuh Mizpah khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Jefthah nynh Ammon hae siapharan kalan khe locceihtu hae saw hae zah, “Ka ram kha dou khylan ka kalan ccianua ciate nang te kae laku paw bya mou a um?” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ammon hae siapharan nynh Jefthah a locceihtu hae kha, “Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate oun ccia lya hae khe ka ram kha Arnon vaw kyate Jabbok vaw kyacia, Jordan vaw phe thua lan a law hae keiccu nynh thua; tukeiccuze atu daebabi lante yn pyathui,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jefthah nynh Ammon hae siapharan kalan khe locceihtu hae kha bua saw hae zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Jefthah nynh hynhte aho: Israel hae nynh Moab ram thuasah, Ammon hae ram thuasah lah khyh hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />thuasalama Izip ram kyate oun kaethung lya hae ze, Israel hae nynh ramkaw kyakhate Rili Se kalan po cceih hae zah, Kadesh khua a thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh Edom siapharan kalan locceihtu hae saw hae zah, ‘Na ram lungkhu kya beih oun cciasah,’ a cipya hae; thuasalama Edom siapharan nynh ua khyh hae, Moab siapharan kalan saw hae zahmah a nawccah khyh. Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh Kadesh khua kya a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:14-21">Nam 20.14-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Te ramkaw kyakhate cceih hae zah Edom ram te Moab ram kha po voi hae zah Moab ram nithua langkhe a thua hae, te Arnon khuraw langkhe a rya hae. Moab ram lungkhu lang tee khyh hae, pawccecize Arnon vaw tuh Moab ramri nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Nam 21.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh Amor hae siapharan Sihon, Heshbon siapharan kalan khe locceihtu hae kha a saw hae; te Israel hae nynh amaw kha, ‘Na ram lungkhu te kae ram lang po beih oun ccia sah,’ cite a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.19-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-24">Nam 21.21-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Sihon nynh Israel kha a ram lungkhu po ccia lan zyn khyh; tukeiccuze Sihon nynh a ccungccaw hae balyn kha pum hae zah, Jahaz kya ryahmin tahkute Israel kha a tuk. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh Sihon te a ccungccaw hae balyn kha Israel kuih kalan pya hae zah a tae hae; tukeiccuze tuin ram kya umpaw Amor hae ram balyn kha Israel hae nynh a law hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh Amor hae ram balyn kha Arnon kyate Jabbok kyacia, ramkaw kyate Jordan vaw kyacia a law hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a ccungccaw Israel hae hanlan Amor hae kha a taepya hae. Nang nynh mih umnaw hmin kha law lan na tuaku tou? <verse number="24" style="v" />Na pachia Khemosh nynh ccou lan ae pyapaw kha na ccou lan ccan khyh tou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh kae hanlan oun taepyapaw miakaw kha kaening nynh kae ccou lan khyh tou? <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ram e Zippor ccapaw Siapharan Balak laeze nang tuh na hoyhua zawtou? Aning nynh Israel hae kha a dou boi hae zawtou? Minmin kha tuk khylan a ccianua boi hae zawtou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Nam 22.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon te a khua taraw hae kya te Aroer vahue umpaw khua hae balyn kya Israel hae nynh kum za thum a um lya hae khe, pawccemou nanning nynh na lawthui khyh oh? <verse number="27" style="v" />Kae tuh na tungvaw ka sei khyh, kae kha nae tuk keiccuze nang tuh ka tungvaw na sei. Byapiatu athuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh atunin kya Israel hae te Ammon hae laku byapae vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama Jefthah nynh bya a tawpaw kha Ammon hae siapharan nynh pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jefthah Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh Jefthah tungvaw yn thua zah, Gilead ram te Manasseh ram kya po a cceih. Gilead ram Mizpah khua lang po cceih zah, Gilead ram Mizpah khua kyate Ammon hae kalan po a cceih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Jefthah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya byakinkuh zah, “Ammon hae hynh ka kuih kya nae pya zetuh, <verse number="31" style="v" />Ammon hae kyate taenaw te he ka ki te, kae kha cciadue khylan ka inn thuakaw kyate yn poupaw ahumhung zemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e athua cih zah, maee-ute silawnaw lante kae pya cih,” a ci. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tetuh Jefthah tuh Ammon hae kha tuk khylan cceih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha a kuih kya a pya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Aroer kyate Minnith khua pe cia, Abel-keramim khua kyacia khua khuakuin kha patae a tae hae. Tuhcite Israel hae malang khe Ammon hae tuh a shung hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jefthah Ccanung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jefthah tuh Mizpah kya umpaw a inn lang yn cceih zah, a ccanung nynh amaw kha cciadue khylan vaedaw khuakute law biate yn cceih. Aning tuh lu kheit kyalyapaw ccanung nynh thua, tuhlaepaw ccanung ccapaw hoi vae khyh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Jefthah nynh a ccanung kha he a muih tuh, a boeining kha seii zah, “Ezou, ka ccanung! Ka thinlung phe nae koisah vae; nang tuh myarya lepaw vawsawnaw yn pyatu lang nynh phe na tang vae. Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bya phe ka ho vae, bya ka kinkupaw kha ka lahthui kho vae lan khyh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Nam 30.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v" />Aning nynh a paaw kha, “Apang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bya phe na ho vae zetuh, na mung te na ho vae thyhte ka tungvaw yn cyih, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na rhaw Ammom hae tungvaw phu ae lawsah vae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Te aning nynh a paaw kha, “E uccaw hynh beih yn cyipya tua: Sawpaw sah ning lungkhu beih yn cciasah tua, tuhteze nynh ka cceih cih zah mua vawlan khiakute liaccady ka thuanaw hynh ka ban hae ryte kae rawkhae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />A paaw nynh, “La cceih,” cipah zah sawpaw sah ning lungkhu a saw. Tukeiccuze a ban hae ryte cceih hae zah, mua vawlan khe liaccady athuanaw kha a rawkhae hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Sawpaw sah ning aro te, a paaw kalan yn ki zah, a paaw nynh bya a kinku thyhte a tungvaw a cyi. Tuh-e nopinung tuh pise te ihkheih boi khyh hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e tuh Israel hae kya phungtho lang yn tang zah, <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel minphuin nopi hae nynh Gilead phin Jefthah ccanung hanlan raw khylan kum kheit ze nin pali atolang a pou hae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lungloku leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim phin hae tuh zunghe lawkute Zafon lang cceih hae zah Jefthah kha, “Ammon hae tuk khylan kaening kha kobua leite pawccemou vaw na zua? Na inn ryte maee kae soihbia cih oh!” a cipya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jefthah nynh minmin kha, “Kae te ka ccungccaw hae tuh Ammon hae ryte thawte kae rhawkuh. Nanning kha kae ko oh zah mih kuih kyate nae luesah khyh oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nae luesah khyh oh paw kha he ka muih tuh, ka chi ze ka chih cite Ammon hae kha tuk khylan vaw kha ka zua, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha ka kuih kya yn pya hae. Kae kha tuk khylan pawccemou atunin nae ccianua oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Jefthah nynh Gilead hae kha pum hae zah Efraim kha a tuk hae; “Efraim te Manasseh hae thinlung kya tuh nanning Gilead hae hynh Efraim phin kyate a ccue hae paw nynh na thua oh,” cite Efraim hae nynh a ci hae keiccuze Gilead hae nynh minmin kha a chia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead hae nynh Jordan vaw zuanaw balyn kha Efraim hae kha a khee hae. A ccuepaw Efraim hae lukhakheit nynh, “Vaw hynh beih yn zua sah,” a ci ze, Gilead hae nynh, “Efraim phin na thua tou?” cite khia hae zah, “Ka thua khyh,” a ci ze, <verse number="6" style="v" />minmin nynh, “Tuhteze Shibboleth cite hotua,” cipah hae zah, aroi akyh lante hothya khyh zah, “Sibboleth” a ci. Tetuh minmin nynh amaw kha kyng hae zah Jordan vaw zuanaw kyakhe a chia hae. Tuh-e ccyh lya Efraim hae sung pali thong ning a chih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jefthah nynh Israel kha kum taruh a uk. Gilead minphuinpaw Jefthah tuh chih zah Gilead ram e amaw khua kyakhe a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ibzan, Elon te Abdon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jefthah koute Bethlehem khuapaw Ibzan nynh Israel kha a uk. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh ccapaw sung thum a hoi. A ccanung hae sung thum kha amaw phin athua lei hae paw kya tungtuhsah hae zah, a ccapaw hae hanlan ccanglang e liaccaw hae sung thum kha a thuakhae hae. Aning nynh Israel kha kum sari a uk. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Ibzan tuh chih zah Bethlehem kya a uu hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning koute Zebulun phinpaw Elon nynh Israel kha kum haw a uk. <verse number="12" style="v" />Zebulun phinpaw Elon tuh chih zah, Zebulun ram e Aijalon khua kya a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning koute Pirathon khua kya umpaw Hillel ccapaw Abdon nynh Israel kha a uk. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh lann sung sari a ccikuh hae paw ccapaw sung pali te mintaw pise sung thum a hoi; aning nynh Israel kha kum tarya a uk. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pirathon khua kya umpaw Hillel ccapaw Abdon tuh chih zah, Amalek hae kya-e muaram, Efraim ram lungkhu e Pirathon khua khe a uu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samson Puinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha bua rae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Filistin hae kuih kya kum sung pali lungkhu a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zorah khuapaw, Dan phin athuapaw, a min Manoah cikuhpaw lu kheit a um, a zu tuh tiin zah ccaawsaah khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh tuh-e nopinung kya yn langkuh zah, “Nang tuh na tiin zah ccaaw na saah khyh zemah, ccaaw na poi cih zah ccapaw na saah cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Misutui thuasah, ruithyapaw thuasah na nia khyh nawlan te athyaa leipaw pawpaw mah na ae khyh nawlan raeringkuh, <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize ccaaw na poi cih zah ccapaw na saah cih. A sang na ngo lan khyh, pawccecize imuapaw tuh a pui takaw te Pachia hanlan nazir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nazir </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh misutui nia lei lante, athyaa leipaw looh ae lei lante, sang ngoku lei lante, rhua ty lei lante byakinkuh zah Pachia a zynnaw a langsakuhpaw ccungccaw nynh thua (Nam 6:1-8 kha do).</char></note> ccungccaw athua cih. Aning tuh Filistin hae kuih kyate Israel hae kha luesah khylan rya a thotu athua cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:1-5">Nam 6.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh nopinung nynh a vawpaw kalan cceih zah, “Pachia ccungccapaw lu kheit ka kya yn thua, a muinsan tuh Pachia vaawpaw muinsan te lokuh zah ri lan myarya um; tei kyate mou nae thua cite ka khia khyh, a min mah yn hopakuh khyh; <verse number="7" style="v" />thuasalama aning nynh kae kha, ‘Ccaaw na poi cih zah ccapaw na saah cih. Tukeiccuze misutui thuasah, ruithyapaw thuasah na neih lan khyh zah athyaa leipaw pawpaw mah na ae lan khyh, pawccecize imuapaw tuh a pui takaw te a chih cia Pachia hanlan nazir ccungccaw athua cih,’ a ci,” cite a hopya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh Manoah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ngia zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Pachia ccungccapaw nae sawpaw kha kae kalan bua yn thua sah lah, yn pui cih paw imuapaw kha pawtemou kae cyih cih cipaw yn ccangpah sah cite kae ngia,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh Manoah bya kha ngae zah, Pachia vaawpaw tuh loo kya a haungpaw nopinung kalan khe bua yn thua; thuasalama a vawpaw Manoah tuh tuh-e nopinung kya umbua khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nopinung tuh a vawpaw kalan arangte ccue zah, “Zekhanin lya ka kya yn langkuhpaw ccungccapaw kha atu bua yn langkuh vae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Manoah nynh thokuh zah a zu kha a zui, te ccungccapaw kya thua zah, “Nang hynh hynh-e nopinung bya a hopahpaw kha na thua tou?” cite khia zah, “Ka thua,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Manoah nynh, “Na bya he yn ccing te, imuapaw tuh a umtuzia pawtemou athua cih zah pawmou a cyih cih?” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Manoah kha, “Ka hopyapaw balyn kha nopinung nynh raeringkuh sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Misu ku kyate a poupaw miakaw kha nopinung nynh ae lan khyh; misutui thuasah, ruithyapaw thuasah neih lan khyh zah, athyaa leipaw pawpaw mah ae lan khyh; kaw ka pyapaw miakaw kha aning nynh a sungkuh cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Manoah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kha, “Nang hynh beih kae kang hin sah lah, miaa taraw kha kae paccynpah hin sah,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Manoah kha, “Kae hynh nae kang zemah na looh kha ka ae lan khyh; thuasalama maee-ute silawnaw kha na paccyn ry zetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan raetua,” a cipya. (Pawccecize Manoah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh thua cipaw nyh khyh.) <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Manoah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kha, “Na bya he yn ccing te, saw kae tuathya nawlan na min tuh hum cikuh mou?” a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh amaw kha, “Pawccemou ka min nae khia? Ka min tuh myaryasankae ngaeangthua lan umpaw nynh thua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:29">Gen 32.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Manoah nynh miaa taraw te ccathae silawnawpaw kha lah zah, lungpi vawlan khe ngaeangthua lan umpaw rya a lahpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a pya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Silawhang kyate maeesoi tuh vaawlang kaethung zah, Manoah te a zu nynh a do lya hae khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh silawhang kya-e maeesoi kya a kaethung; te mih mae kha laekhu lang a bakhung hae. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh Manoah te a zu kalan bua langkuh vae khyh. Tetuh Manoah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh thua cipaw a ny. <verse number="22" style="v" />Manoah nynh a zu kyakhe, “Pachia kha ah muih keiccuze solei chi lan vae,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama a zu nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hynh chia yn ry ze, maee-ute silawnaw te ccathae silawnaw kha oun ccoupah lan khyh, e uccaw hae balyn hynh oun muihsah lan khyh zah, atu lyahin hynh-e uccaw hae hynh mah oun hopah lan khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh ccapaw saah zah Samson cite min a phu. Imuapaw tuh yn lethung zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua a pya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Zorah te Eshtaol laku umpaw Mahaneh-dan kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw nynh aning kha thawzung a pya takaw vae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samson Zudynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaekheit lyaze Samson tuh Timnah khua lang la cceih zah, tuin khua kyakhe Filistin nopinung lu kheit kha a muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te yn ki zah a nung te a paaw kha, “Timnah khua kya Filistin nopinung lu kheit kha ka muih; aning kha ka zu lang yn dypah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama a nung te a paaw nynh, “Na puizia hae kya thuasah, ah minphuin hae kya thuasah nopi a um khyh keiccu tou vingdungawkuh leipaw Filistin hae laku e zu kha dyku lan na cceih cih?” a cipya hae. Thuasalama Samson nynh a paaw kha, “Aning tuh ka lungry yn tung keiccuze zu lang yn dypah oh,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate nynh thua cipaw kha a nung te a paaw nynh nyh khyh hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Filistin hae kha dou khylan ccyhhoy kha a ccung. Tuh ccyh lya tuh Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha a uk hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Samson tuh a nung te a paaw ryte Timnah khua lang cceih hae zah, Timnah misu khokhu hae kya he a thua hae tuh, chindeih nopaw sa kheit nynh amaw kha vaekheihmawte a sianua. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh a tungvaw yn thua zah, miaa taraw kha thoh pae hawte a kuih kyalya te tuh-e chindeih tuh thoh a pae. Thuasalama a cyipaw kha a nung te a paaw hopah khyh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te cceih zah tuh-e nopinung te byabeihkuh hae zah, nopinung nynh Samson kha a lungry a ccingsah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sosoh koute tuh-e nopinung kha zu lang dy khylan a kinua, chindeih rhua kha do khylan laanpi kyate ccanglang cceih zah, chindeih pyn lungkhu kya khoibu te khoitui a um. <verse number="9" style="v" />A kuih te lawkuh zah a ccia lyakhe a aebia. A nung te a paaw kya he a thua te, beihtaraw pyabua hae zah a ae hae. Thuasalama khoitui tuh chindeih rhua kya-e a lawpaw kha hopah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A paaw tuh nopinung kalan cceih zah, ccangvae hae nynh poi leih a tua hae hawte, tuin kyakhe Samson nynh poi a tua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh Samson kha he a muih hae tuh, a kya umbua khylan ruiban sung thum a thuakhae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Samson nynh minmin kha, “Phohpawbya kae hopah cih oh. Poi nin ninsari lungkhu asuilan nae ccaesahpah oh zah na ny kho oh zetuh, nebaleihpaw boei zung sung thum te liakunawpaw boeining zung sung thum kha kae pya cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama asuilan nae ccaesahpya kho khyh oh zetuh, nebaleihpaw boei zung sung thum te liakunawpaw boeining zung sung thum kha nae pya cih oh,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh, “Na phohpawbya tuh yn hotua, kae la ngaetua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Samson nynh minmin kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“A aetu lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">aepaw a pou,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawsaepaw lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">a-epaw a pou,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="m">Tuh-e phohpawbya tuh minmin nynh nin thum lungkhu ccaesah kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nin palinaw nin khe minmin nynh Samson zu kha, “Na vawpaw nynh phohpawbya kha oun ccaesahpya nawlan soihbiatua, tuhkhyhze tuh nang te na paaw innbyn hae kha maee te kae soi cih oh. Kaening hynh ryachisah khylan tou hynhlang hin nae ko oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samson zu nynh a malang khe rah zah, “Kae hynh nae hua; nae sungsah ccaccing khyh. Ka minphuin hae kha phohpawbya na khia hae, thuasalama asuilan kha kae hynh nae ccaesahpah khyh,” a cipya. Samson nynh a zu kha, “Dotua, ka nung ka paaw hae mah ka hopah khyh hae. Pawccemou nang kha kae hopah cih?” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mih poi phe thang lan, nin sari lungkhu Samson malang khe a rah; palei a ngia keiccuze nin sarinaw nin khe a hopya. Tetuh a zu nynh phohpawbya kha a minphuin hae kya a ccaesahpya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nin sarinaw nin khuanin ccaw mawkhe, khuaccaaw hae nynh amaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Khoitui laeze pawmou a ehua?</para>
  <para style="q2">Chindeih laeze pawmou</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawsaehua?”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopya hae. Aning nynh minmin kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka vaetua tohlaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">na thue khyh oh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka phohpawbya hynh na nyh</para>
  <para style="q2">kho lan khyh oh,”</para>
  <para style="m">a cipya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh a tungvaw yn thua, te Ashkelon khua lang cceih zah khuaccaaw hae sung thum kha theih hae zah mih boeining kha lah zah phohpawbya a ccaesah hae paw kalan khe liakunawpaw boei hae kha a pya hae. Myarya thinriate a paaw inn lang a ki. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te a zu kha Samson a ruibanpaw, a ban hoy huapaw kalan khe a pya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samson nynh Filistin hae A Tae hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh aro koute, chanvuih rue lyakhe, Samson tuh miaa taraw ccyngte a zu kalan paebua lan cceih zah, “Ka zu khaan lungkhu lang ka tee cih,” a ci. Thuasalama a zu paaw nynh tee lan kaw-ua khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />A zu paaw nynh, “Ka ccanung kha na vua vae cipaw phe ria lan ka ny; tukeiccuze aning kha na banpaw kalan ka pya vae. A neitawnung tuh amaw laeze a puithyahua khaw? A unung hanpaw a neitawnung hynh lawkuh,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Samson nynh minmin kha, “Atu lya tuh, Filistin hae tungvaw hoyleinaw ka rae zemah, yn seisah lan khyh hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samson nynh cceih zah suizaw za thum kha kyng zah, maeccatung kha lah zah mih leihmae hae kha ccangkheit te ccangkheit piade hae zah, tuh-e leihmae ccangning hae laku khe maeccatung kha ccarou a heede. <verse number="5" style="v" />Maeccatung hae kha maee a tyh koute, Filistin hae loohku a thadyn hae paw kalan khe suizaw hae kha saw hae zah, loohku hae, loohcce hae ryte misu khokhu hae te oliv khokhu hae kha maee nynh a u hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Filistin hae nynh, “E hynh hummou a cyih?” a ci hae. Minmin nynh, “Timnah khua e lukheitpaw paeepaw Samson nynh a cyih, pawccecize Samson zu kha ko zah a banpaw kha a pya,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Filistin hae tuh oun cceih hae zah tuh-e nopinung te a paaw kha maee te a soi hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Samson nynh minmin kha, “Hynhte na cyi oh keiccuze phu kae law mawlaezung oh umtaw lei lante thyalawkute bya ka kinku,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha patae a chia hae; te cceihbung zah Etam lungpi karung kya a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh Filistin hae tuh oun cceih hae zah Judah ram kya ryahmin tahkute Lehi khua kha a thiing hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah hae nynh, “Pawccemou nae ccianua oh?” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Samson nynh kae tungvaw a cyi hawte a tungvaw cyirute khiide khylan nynh kae ccia,” a ci hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Judah hae thong thum nynh Etam lungpi karung lang cceih hae zah Samson kha, “Filistin hae tuh aening oun uktu hae cipaw na nyh khyh tou? Pawccemou kae tungvaw hynhte na cyi?” a cipya hae. Aning nynh, “Minmin nynh oun cyi hae hawte minmin kha ka cyi hae,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah hae nynh, “Nang kha Filistin hae kuih kya pya lan cite nang kha khiide khylan kae thua vae,” a cipya hae. Samson nynh minmin kha, “Naemaw ccaccei nynh kae hynh nae chia khyh nawlan oh thyalawkute bya yn kinpakuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin nynh Samson kha, “Kaening nynh nang kha khiide kyalya kae khiide cih zah mih kuih kya kae ap cih; kaening nynh nang kha kae theih lan khyh,” a cipya hae. Tetuh minmin nynh liarui thawpaw ccangning te aning kha khiide hae zah, lungpi kyate a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samson tuh Lehi khua he a thua te, Filistin hae nynh sia biate a thuanua hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh vaekheihmawte a tungvaw yn thua zah, a kuih kya umpaw liarui hae tuh maee te a tungkuh hae paw laphan hawte thua hae zah, a khiidenaw hae paw liarui tuh a kuih kya palae tui vae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te aning nynh lann a khawru thawpapingpaw kha muih zah, dyngnuakute a law, tuh-e tuhte ccungccaw thong kheit kha a chia. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Samson nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Lann a khawru te</para>
  <para style="q2">patah khanthykuh lan ka pum vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">lann a khawru te</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw thong kheit</para>
  <para style="q1">ka chia vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bya a ho koute, lann khawru kha ccaring a vua; te tuh-e hmin tuh Ramath-lehi a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samson tuh myarya tuihaw zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ko zah, “E myarya lepaw taenaw hynh na seepaw kuih kya nae pya vae. Atu tui kanmawte ka chih cih zah, vingdungawkuh lei hae paw kuih kya tou ka thua vae cih?” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Pachia nynh Lehi khua kya akarungpaw hmin kha poh uasah zah, tuin kyate tui apou. Aning nynh tui kha neih zah a hy yn sue zah a thaw yn um. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh En-hakkore cite a minphu hae zah atunin cia Lehi khua kya a um. <verse number="20" style="v" />Samson nynh Filistin hae she lya Israel hae kha kum kuin a uk hae.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samson te Delilah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaekheih tuh Samson nynh Gaza khua lang cceih zah, tuin kyakhe ohhuanung lu kheit kha muih zah a ikhae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Gaza hae kha, “Samson hein kya yn thua,” cite a hopya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh koihlu hae zah aning kha khua koikua kyakhe zidae a buh hae. “Awkhualan khuadae cia ngaw oh sih; te aning kha chia lan,” cite hokuh hae zah azi zidae daebabi lan a um hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Samson tuh ziraccyng cia kyalya ih zah ziraccyng khe thokuh zah khua koikua thuakaw hae kha a tung ccangning te thuakaccong ryte abalyn mawte a raw kya puih zah, Hebron malang umpaw sangpyng dung langkhe a cciakhae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e koute Sorek accya kya umpaw nopinung, a min Delilah cikuhpaw kha a sungsah. <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistin bawi hae nynh tuh-e nopinung kalan cceih hae zah, “Paw nynh mou Samson hynh hynhte myarya a thaw a saesah cipaw te aning kha khiite kae tae kho nawlan pawtemou kae cyih cih cipaw kha ny nawlan soihbia lah, a laanpi yn ccungtua; kaening nynh nang kha ngunphua thong kheit za kheit cci kae pya cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Delilah nynh Samson kha, “Paw nynh mou hynhte myarya na thaw ae saesah cipaw te nang hynh tae kho nawlan pawtemou khii kho na ung cih cipaw kha beih yn hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Samson nynh amaw kha, “Arou loh leipaw lirui thawpaw ccangsari te yn khii hae zetuh, ka thawzya cih zah mingccangpaw hawte ka thua vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh Filistin bawi hae nynh tuh-e nopinung tuh arou loh leipaw lirui thawpaw ccangsari kha ccyngpah hae zah, aning nynh tuh-e lirui tuhte Samson kha a khii. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh alungkhu lang e innkhaan kya a buh lya hae khe, nopinung nynh, “Samson, Filistin hae nynh ae thuanua vae hae!” a cipya. Thuasalama maee te a tungkuh hae paw law hawte aning nynh lirui hae kha pong a pae. Tukeiccuze a thawzung a umnaw kha nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Delilah nynh Samson kha, “Nae theihrya zah nae ling; pawtemou khiide kho na thua cih cipaw kha beih yn hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Samson nynh, “Mang boi leipaw liarui thawpaw hae te yn khii hae zetuh ka thawzya cih zah, mingccangpaw hawte ka thua vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Delilah nynh liarui thawpaw hae kha lah zah, tuh-e tuhte khii zah, “Samson, Filistin hae nynh ae thuanua vae hae!” a cipya. (A buhtu hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh alungkhu lang e innkhaan kya a um hae.) Thuasalama aning nynh a kuih kya-e liarui hae kha laawrui hawte pong a pae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Delilah nynh Samson kha, “Atu cia nae theihrya zah nae ling; pawtemou khiide kho na thua cih cipaw kha beih yn hopya tua,” a cipya. Samson nynh, “Ka lu kya-e sangkhe ccangsari hynh boeikua kya na kuabia zah, phaeccya te na reihde zetuh, ka thawzya cih zah mingccangpaw hawte ka thua vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a i lyakhe, Delilah nynh a lu kya-e a sangkhe ccangsari kha lah zah, boeikua kya kuabia zah phaeccya te a reihde. Te aning nynh, “Samson, Filistin hae nynh ae thuanua vae hae!” a cipya. Thuasalama a inaw kyate yn thokuh zah phaeccya, boeikua te boeikuanawpaw kha pong a phoh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Delilah nynh Samson kha, “Na thinlung te nae ry lei pite pawtemou, ‘Kae sungsah,’ cite na ho kho? Atu vae thum cia nae theihrya zah, na thaw myarya ae saesahpaw kha nae hopah khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nyathyakou tuh, Delilah nynh a bya te nin takyh soihbiate a ngia keiccuze Samson tuh phe chi lan ciate a lungriathae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samson nynh a thinlung kya umpaw balyn kha hopah zah, “Ka sang hynh ngo boi leipaw nynh thua; pawccecize kae tuh ka nung vue lungkhu te Pachia hanlan Nazir ccungccaw nynh ka thua. Ka sang hynh ngo zetuh ka thawzung nynh yn cciataw cih; te ka thawzya cih zah mingccangpaw hawte ka thua vae cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thinlung kya umpaw balyn kha yn hopah vae cipaw Delilah nynh he a nyh tuh, Filistin bawi hae kha kosah hae zah, “Atu vae kheit kyalya oun cciatua hin oh, pawccecize aning nynh a thinlung kya umpaw balyn kha pong yn hopya vae,” a cipya hae. Tetuh Filistin bawi hae tuh a kalan oun cceih hae zah, mih kuih kya phua kha a ccyngpya bia hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Delilah nynh a phae vawlan marya a isah; te pise lu kheit kha ko zah a lu kya-e sangkhe ccangsari kha a ngosah. Tuh-e paw nynh a thawzyasah zah, a thawzung nynh a cciataw vae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh Delilah nynh, “Samson, Filistin hae nynh ae thuanua vae hae!” a cipya. A inaw kyate yn thokuh zah, “Ninhyn hawte ka pou cih zah, kamaw te kamaw ka luesakuh cih,” cite a tuaku. Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn cciataw vae cipaw nyhkuh khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh Filistin hae nynh kyng hae zah a mitlung a khoi hae. Gaza khua lang cciakhae hae zah sohin bawtary te a khiide hae; te thong lungkhu khe sungmia te looh kha a miasah hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama a lu kya-e sang tuh a ngo kou hae te, bua yn sae takaw vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Samson Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Filistin bawi hae tuh mih pachia Dagon kalan myarya lepaw silawnaw rae khylan te lungpawnaw rae khylan a sueluakuh hae; pawccecize minmin nynh, “Ah pachia nynh ah rhawpaw Samson kha ah kuih kya oun pya vae,” a ciku hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh Samson kha he a muih hae tuh, mih pachia kha thehoysah hae zah, “Ah pachia nynh ah ram rohtupaw, aening patae oun theihtupaw, ah rhawpaw kha ah kuih kya oun pya vae,” a ci hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Myaryamaw mih lung he apaw tuh, “Samson kha yn ko oh, ah lung oun pawsah tua sah,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Samson kha thong lungkhu te atolang poukhae hae zah, aning nynh lungpawnaw a raepya hae. Tung hae laku khe a thadynsah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />A kuih te a kyngtupaw imuapaw kha Samson nynh, “Inn a tuhdoupaw tung hae kya ka ngeiku ccaw, tung hae kha ka kuih te beih yn hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Inn kya nopi pise phe abeih hae; Filistin bawi hae balyn tuh tuin kya a um hae, innccuvaw kya mah Samson nynh lungpawnaw a raepya hae paw a dotu hae nopi pise thong thum loukaw a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tetuh Samson nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ko zah, “Bawipaw PACHIA, atu vae kheit kyalya kae hynh yn liathui lah, thawzung beih yn pya. Pou Pachia, tuhteze nynh ka mitlung ccangning hanlan phulawnaw vae kheit kyalya raete Filistin hae hynh ka liaru kho cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Samson nynh inn a tuhdoupaw angaelung e tung ccangning hae kha a ranglang kuih te ccangkheit, a voilang kuih te ccangkheit kyng zah a koinua hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te Samson nynh, “Filistin hae ryte kae chihkheih sah,” a ci; a thawzung balyn thuate a koinua hae; te inn nynh a lungkhu um hae paw bawi hae te ccungccaw hae balyn kha a deih hae. Tukeiccuze a hiin lya a chia hae paw ccungccaw hae laeze a chi lya a chia hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh alunghua hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te a uno hae te a innbyn hae balyn tuh oun thua hae zah a rhua kha lah hae zah cciakhae hae zah, Zorah khua te Eshtaol khua laku umpaw a paaw Manoah shawku kyakhe a uu hae. Aning nynh Israel hae kha kum kuin lungkhu a uk hae.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Mikah te Levi Phinpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim muaram kya a min Mikah cikuhpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh a nung kha, “Na kya-e ngunphua thong kheit za kheit ae lawpah hae zah, tuh-e kong thyalawnaw bya kha ka thaenaw kya na ho; khah-e ngunphua kha ka kya nynh a um, kae nynh ka lah; thuasalama atu kae kii cih,” a cipya. Te a nung nynh, “Ka ccapaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythuapya vae sah!” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh ngunphua thong kheit za kheit kha a nung kalan a kii; a nung nynh, “E ngunphua hynh ka ccapaw hanlan laeepaw zohtuh lang raepya nawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ka pya,” a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh ngunphua kha a nung kalan he a kii te, a nung nynh ngunphua za ning kha lah zah, phualaeetupaw kha a pya, te aning nynh laeepaw zohtuh lang rae zah, tuh-e tuh Mikah inn kya a um. <verse number="5" style="v" />E ccungccapaw Mikah nynh hminthyaa hoi zah, ranpibawi angki te tera zohtuh kha a rae, te a ccapaw lu kheit kha a ranpibawi lang a nung. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh Israel hae kya siapharan um khyh; ccungccaw hae balyn nynh mih muihnaw kya akyh a ci hae paw kha a rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:25">Bpt 21.25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ram kya Judah phin athuapaw, Bethlehem khuapaw ccangvaepaw lu kheit a um. Aning tuh tuin khua kya umpaw Levi phin nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccapaw nynh a muih khopaw hmin miakaw kya khuasah khylan Judah ram Bethlehem khua kyate a pou. A ccia lyakhe Efraim muaram umpaw Mikah inn kya a thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mikah nynh amaw kha, “Paw kyate mou nae thua?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Kae tuh Judah ram e Bethlehem khuapaw Levi phin nynh ka thua, ka muih khopaw hmin miakaw kya khuasah khylan kae cceihpaw nynh thua,” cite a khung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mikah nynh amaw kha, “Ka kya umbua, ka hanlan paaw lang te ranpibawi lang nae umpah cih, kum kheit ze ngunphua kia haw, boeining bua kheit kae pya cih zah aenia kae rin cih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi phinpaw tuh tuh-e paw te umkheih lan a nawccah; te ccangvaepaw tuh a ccapaw hae kyaze lu kheit lang a tang. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Mikah nynh Levi phin ccangvaepaw tuh a ranpibawi lang nungkuh zah, tuh-e ccangvaepaw tuh ranpibawi lang a tang, te Mikah inn kya a um. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikah nynh, “Atu tuh Levi phinpaw tuh ka ranpibawi lang a tang vae keiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laansui-uanaw yn pya vae cih cipaw ka ny,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Mikah te Dan Phin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh Israel hae kya siapharan um khyh. Te tuh ccyh lyatuin Dan phin hae nynh khuasahnaw lanpaw ram a ccungku hae; pawccecize tuh-e ccyh kyacia Israel phin hae kya minmin nynh ram kha ccoubua loh khyh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Dan phin hae nynh ram kha dophi khylan te dotua khylan mih phin pynpi kya-e arawthungpaw pise lu pangaw kha a umnaw hae Zorah khua te Eshtaol khua kyate a saw hae; te minmin nynh, “La cceih oh lah, ram kha la dophi oh lah, la dotua oh,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh Efraim muaram, Mikah inn kya thua hae zah, tuin kya a rya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mikah inn kya a um lya hae khe Levi phin ccangvaepaw roi kha a syntaw hae; tukeiccuze ccianua hae zah amaw kha, “Hum nynh mou hynhlang ae cciakhae? E hmin kya pawmou na cyi? Hein kya paw rya mou na law?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kyakhe, “Mikah nynh tuhte khahte yn cyipya, kae hynh yn hoh zah, a ranpibawi lang ka tang,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh amaw kha, “Kaening nynh kae ccianuathepaw kya kae laan kae sui a ua cih tou, ua lan khyh tou cipaw kae ny ccaw, Pachia kalan khiatua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e ranpibawipaw nynh, “Ngaengante la cceih oh. Nae ccianuathe oh paw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae do-oih cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e lu pangaw hae tuh po cceih hae zah Laish khua he a thua hae te, khuaccaaw hae tuh khyndadyh lan um hae zah Sidon hae umtu hawte lunghiinnaw hoi leite daebabi lan a um hae, lae vawlan hobounaw um lei lante um hae zah, sisua mah a hoi hae. Tukoute Sidon hae te sawkuh hae zah, Siria hae te mah ccuepekuh khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh Zorah khua te Eshtaol khua kya um hae paw mih puizia hae kya he a thua hae te, mih puizia hae nynh, “Pawtemou athua?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Rang oh, ccianua oh sih; pawccecize ram tuh kae muih zah myarya ahoy. Pawpaw mah cyi leite tou na um cih oh? Ccia lan nae thysung nan sah, tee oh sih lah ram kha ccou oh sih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Na ccia oh ze, lunghiin leite a um hae paw ccungccaw hae kha na muih cih oh. Ram tuh myarya ako; lae vawlan hobounaw ccangkheit san a um leinaw hmin kha Pachia nynh nae kuih kya ae pya ccaccing vae oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dan phin kya-e ccungccaw za taruh tuh rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngkute Zorah khua te Eshtaol khua kyate a cceih hae, <verse number="12" style="v" />te cceihthung hae zah Judah ram kya umpaw Kiriath-jearim kya a rya hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh atunin cia Mahaneh-dan a ci hae; tuh-e tuh Kiriath-jearim niccaw langkhe nynh a um. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin kyate Efraim muaram langkhe cceih hae zah, Mikah inn kya a thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh ram (tuh-e tuh Laish) kha dophi khylan a cceih hae paw lu pangaw hae nynh mih vaeccaw hae kyakhe, “E inn hae kyahin ranpibawi angki, tera zohtuh te laeepaw zohtuh a um hae cipaw na nyh oh tou? Tukeiccuze na cyi lan oh paw kha tuakuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh tuh-e hmin langkhe maekuh hae zah Mikah inn kya, Levi phin ccangvaepaw a umnaw inn kya thua hae zah amaw kha bya a beih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan phin ccungccaw za taruh tuh rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngkute sakoih teenaw kya a thadyn lya hae khe, <verse number="17" style="v" />ram dophi khylan a cceih hae paw lu pangaw hae nynh tee hae zah laeepaw zohtuh, ranpibawi angki te tera zohtuh kha a law hae. Ranpibawipaw tuh rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngkuh hae paw za taruh ryte teenaw sakoih pe khe a thadynbua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Lu pangaw hae nynh Mikah inn lungkhu lang tee hae zah laeepaw zohtuh, ranpibawi angki te tera zohtuh kha he a lah hae tuh, ranpibawipaw nynh, “Pawmou na cyi oh?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Yccae nan! Na mung kha na kuih te phang huhkuh lah, kae kya cceihbua, paaw lang te ranpibawi lang nae tangpah cih. Lu kheit innbyn elang ranpibawi lang tang tou namaw hanlan ahoyhua, tuhkhyhze Israel minphuin kya-e phin kheit kya ranpibawi lang tang tou ahoyhua?” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawipaw nynh a nawccah zah, ranpibawi angki, tera zohtuh te laeepaw zohtuh kha lah zah, tuh-e hae kya a cceihbua vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te imua hae, sahiin hae te uccaw hae kha mih malang cciasah hae zah a ki vae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mikah inn te hary asawnaw kya he a thua hae tuh, Mikah inn pe e inn hae kya a um hae paw kha ko hae zah, Dan phin hae kha deehuite a phya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan phin hae kha he a sianua hae tuh, Dan phin hae nynh maeleihnuakuh hae zah Mikah kha, “Hynhzeih ccungccaw hae ryte ccianua lan ciate paw bya mou a um?” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mikah nynh, “Ka raekupaw ka pachia hae te ranpibawi kha na lah oh zah na cciakhae oh, tuhlaepaw ka hoipaw pawmou a um ung? Nanning nynh, ‘Paw bya mou a um?’ cite pawtemou pharung nae khia ngan oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Dan phin hae nynh amaw kha, “Kaening nynh na bya kae thae khyh ze ahoyhua cih, tuhkhyhze tuh mih thinria hae paw nynh nang kha ae zia cih hae zah, na hiinnaw te na innbyn hae innbyn kha nae shungsei cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Dan hae tuh a cceih hae. Mikah nynh amaw hanlan minmin tuh myaryasankae a thung hae cipaw he a muih tuh, maeleihkuh zah a inn lang a ki vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Dan Phin hae Laish kya Khuasah hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikah nynh a raekupaw uccaw hae te a ranpibawipaw kha cciakhae hae zah, lunghiinnaw hoi leite daebabi lan um hae paw Laish khuaccaaw hae kya a thua hae, thaloi te bae hae zah, khuapi kha maee te a soi hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuh-e khua tuh Sidon khua te sawkuh zah, humhung te mah a ccuepeku khyh hae keiccuze a pankhaetu um khyh. Tuh-e khua tuh Beth-rehob khua nynh a hoipaw accya kya nynh a um. Dan phin hae nynh tuh-e khua tuh sakthui hae zah a umnaw hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel ccapaw mih minpaaw Dan min kha lee hae zah, tuh-e khua tuh Dan cite min a phu hae; tuh-e khua a min rynpaw tuh Laish acikuh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te Dan phin hae nynh tuh-e zohtuh tuh mimaw elang a thadynsaku hae. Moses ccapaw Gershom a ccapaw Jonathan te a ccapaw hae tuh, ramccang hae nynh ram kha a law makhia hae, Dan phin hanlan ranpibawi lang a tang hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Shiloh khua kya Pachia inn a um lungkhu balyn tuh, Mikah nynh a raekupaw zohtuh kha mimaw zohtuh lang a nungku hae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Levi Phinpaw te A Lovaenung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh-e she lya, Israel hae kya siapharan a um khyh lyakhe, Efraim muaram asawnaw kya umpaw Levi phinpaw lu kheit nynh Judah ram Bethlehem khua e kha lovae lang a hoiku. <verse number="2" style="v" />A tungvaw kya a lovaenung nynh a thinria zah, a kyate Judah ram Bethlehem khua umpaw a paaw inn lang ccue zah, tuin kya sawpaw sah pali loukaw a um. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te a vawpaw nynh byanepaw te hopya lan zah kikhae lan cite a ccianua. Aning nynh a ryalahtupaw te lann bua kheit kha a cciakhae hae. A lovaenung a paaw inn kya he a thua te, nopinung a paaw nynh muih zah tungku lan lungpawte a cciadue. <verse number="4" style="v" />A pupaw, nopinung a paaw nynh kang zah nin thum a um; tukeiccuze ae hae neih hae zah, tuin kya a um hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nin palinaw nin tuh awkhua takaw te tho hae zah, ccia lan a paccynkuh vae; thuasalama nopinung a paaw nynh a paeepaw kha , “Looh beihtaraw ae hin lah, na thawsaesakuh hin, tukoute na cceih cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lu ning te dahung hae zah a ae a neihkheih hae; te nopinung a paaw nynh a paeepaw kha, “Atu khuazi tuh rya hin lah, lungpawte um hin,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />A paeepaw nynh ccia lan vae cite he a thokuh tuh, a pupaw nynh a paeepaw kha tuin kya khuazi bua a rya mawlaezung kang zah bua a rya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nin pangawnaw nin khe a paeepaw tuh ccia lan vae cite awkhua takaw te a thokuh; te nopinung a paaw nynh, “Na thawsaesakuh hin,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze khuanin phe laeleih lan lu ning mawte a ae a neih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />A paeepaw tuh a lovaenung te a ryalahtupaw ryte ccia lan vae cite he a thokuh hae tuh, a pupaw, nopinung a paaw nynh, “Dotua, zetesang thua vae. Atu khuazi mah rya hin. Dotua, khua vyavya zi vae. Hein kya khuazi rya hin lah, lungpawte umtua. Awkhualan awkhua takaw te tho lah, na inn lang na cceih cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e paw tuh khuazi rya vae khyh; thokuh zah cceih zah Jebus (tuh-e tuh Jerusalem) rawlang khe a thua. Lannde dekuhpaw lann bua kheit te a lovaenung tuh amaw kya a umbua hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jebus khua lang he a naekuh hae tuh, khuanin vyavya ccah vae zah a ryalahtupaw nynh a bawipaw kha, “Yn cceih, e Jebus hae khua lang tee oh sih lah, e khua kya rya oh sih,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />A bawipaw nynh, “Israel ccungccaw a um leinaw ramccang hae khua lang tee lei lan; Gibeah khua lang po ccia lan,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te a ryalahtupaw kha, “Rang, e hmin hae sankhakheit kya thua kho nawlan zuakuh oh sih, Gibeah khua khyhze Ramah khua kya rya lan,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze po sulue hae zah a cceih hae; Benjamin phin kya-e Gibeah khua pe a thua hae tuh, khuanin nynh a ccawtaw hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Gibeah khua kya khuazi rya khylan tuhlang tuin a tee hae. Khualae lang tee zah khua ngaelung kya a haung, lu kheit nynh sanmah khuazi rya nawlan innccong thuasah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te zete vae tuh paawpipaw lu kheit tuh loo kya rya a lawnaw kyate yn ki. Tuh-e paw tuh Efraim muaram e ccungccapaw thua zah Gibeah khua kya a um buapaw nynh thua. (Tuin hmin kya-e ccungccaw hae tuh Benjamin phin hae nynh thua hae). <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e paawpipaw nynh do zah khua ngaelung kya khyccepaw kha he a muih tuh, “Teilangmou na cceih cih oh? Tei kyate mou nae thua oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh paawpipaw kha, “Judah ram Bethlehem khua kyate kae cceih zah, ka umnaw Efraim muaram asawnaw lang kae cceih cih. Judah ram Bethlehem khua lang ka la cceih zah, atu tuh ka inn lang kae ki vae paw nynh thua. Humhung nynh mah innccong oun thuasah khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ryalahtu hae kaening tuh kae lann hae hanlan ccatanphue te a looh mah kae hoi, kamaw te nopinung te kae kya um buapaw ccangvaepaw hanlan sanlou te misutui mah kae hoi. Kaening hanlan ahopaw um vae khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Paawpipaw nynh, “Na kya daenaw um vae sah. Na hobounaw balyn kha kae do-oihpah cih; khua ngaelung laanpi kya tuh rya nan oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a inn lang teekhae zah, lann hae kha looh a dang hae; mih ccu singkuh hae zah a ae a neih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gibeah Khua A Seinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih lungpaw cciamang lyakhe, accouseikuh hae paw khuaccaaw hae abang nynh inn kha koihlute thuakaw kha bua hae zah, innzuaapaw paawpipaw kha, “Na inn thuapaw pisepaw kha kaening nynh kae ikhae ccaw, yn toisakuh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.22-24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:5-8">Gen 19.5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Innzuaapaw, ccungccapaw nynh pounua hae zah, “Uteno hae, myaryamaw ahoy leipaw kha rae nan oh. E paw tuh ka mikhiapaw athua keiccuze, e anungsikuhpaw uccaw hynh rae nan oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Hein kya ka ccanung liaccady te mikhiapaw a lovaenung a um hae; minmin hynh kae poukhae hae sah. Minmin kha ikhaede oh lah, nae rythyte seikhae oh; thuasalama hynh-e pisepaw tungvaw kya hynhcihaw anungsikuhpaw uccaw hynh tuh rae nan oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e hae nynh ngaepah khyh hae. Tukeiccuze mikhiapaw nynh a lovaenung kha kyng zah mih kalan a pousah. Minmin nynh nopinung kha azi zidae awkhua cia, ikhaede hae zah a vawsawsah hae. Awkhua a aw takaw khe a cciasah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuadaetakaw khe, nopinung tuh yn cceih zah a bawipaw a umnaw thuakaw kyakhe raerae aw lan cia a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawipaw tuh awkhua khe tho zah, thuakaw kha hung zah ccia lan vae cite he a pou tuh, a lovaenung tuh thuakawccaw vawlan a kuih khangte thuakaw kya phang a huekuh vae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Aning nynh a lovaenung kha, “Thokuh, ccia lan vae,” a cipya. Thuasalama byakhung vae khyh. Te pisepaw nynh lann tungvaw khang zah, a inn lang a cceih vae. <verse number="29" style="v" />A inn lungkhu lang a tee koute, tangpaw lawkuh zah a lovaenung kha kyng zah a kuih a ccu ryte ccanghaw lae ning lang a tya, te Israel ram pynpi phe lekuh lan a pyasah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:7">1Sa 11.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Aning nynh a pyasah hae paw ccungccaw hae kha kawpyate byataw hae zah, “Nanning nynh Israel hae balyn kha hynhte na hopah cih oh, ‘Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pou nin hae kyate atunin cia, hynhcihawpaw uccaw hynh acyihkuh boi tou? E uccaw hynh tuatua kalang oh, hotua kalang oh lah, ho oh,’ cite na cipah cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Benjamin Phin kha Rhawtuknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae balyn tuh Dan khua kyate Beersheba khua kyacia, Gilead ram e hae ryte oun pou hae zah, ccungccaw zapi hae tuh ccungccaw lu kheitpaw hawte Mizpah khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a pumkuh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn kya-e lupi hae, Israel phin hae balyn kya-e lupi hae tuh Pachia ccungccaw hae a pumkunaw hae kyakhe oun pou hae; zunghe kyngpaw ccu rhawkaw hae cciing pali acih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />(Israel ccungccaw hae tuh Mizpah khua lang a cceih hae cipaw kha Benjamin phin hae nynh a thae hae.) Te Israel hae nynh, “E hoyleinaw hynh pawtemou yn langku? Oun hopya tua oh,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />A chia hae paw nopinung a vawpaw Levi phinpaw nynh, “Kae te ka lovaenung tuh Benjamin phin hae kya-e Gibeah khua kya kae thua zah kae rya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeah khuaccaaw hae nynh oun ccianua hae zah, khuazi khe inn kha a koihlu hae. Kae hynh chia lan yn paccynnuaku hae, te ka lovaenung kha phe chih lan cia a ikhaede hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh ka lovaenung kha ka lah zah pong ka tya koute Israel ram pynpi phe lekuh lan ka pyasah hae; pawccecize minmin nynh Israel ram kya anungsikuhpaw thinlungccinaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu nanning Israel hae nynh nae balynte, e kyahin nae tuanaw te nae roihnaw kha oun hotua kalang oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn nynh ccungccaw lu kheitpaw hawte thokuh hae zah, “Aening lu kheit sanmah ah bu kalan ccia lei lan, lu kheit sanmah ah inn lang ki lei lan. <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeah khua kha hynhte cyi lan: ccungthydungte ccianua lan. <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel phin hae balyn kya-e ccungccaw za kheit kyaze lu haw, thong kheit kyaze za kheit, thong haw kyaze thong kheit kha ko lan hae zah, minmin tuh rhawkaw hae hanlan vaelooh phutu athua cih hae; tuh-e rhawkaw hae tuh Israel ram kya Benjamin phin kya-e Gibeah khua nynh a raepaw thethyanaw balyn hanlan phulaw khylan a cceih cih hae paw nynh thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae balyn tuh pynkheit lante hobungkute tuh-e khua kha a pumnuaku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel phin hae nynh Benjamin phin balyn kya phe lekuh lan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Nanning laku kya acyihkuhpaw hynh-e hoyleinaw hynh pawtemou athua? <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu Gibeah khua kya-e a ccouseikuh hae paw kha chiate Israel kyate hoyleinaw kha kae zosah nawlan, kae kalan oun pya oh,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama Benjamin phin hae nynh mih uno Israel hae bya kha ngae khyh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel hae ryte rhawtukkunaw kalan ccia khylan Benjamin phin hae tuh khua hae kyate Gibeah khua lang a sueluakuh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin nin khe, Gibeah khuaccaaw hae nynh a po hae paw milu za sari riabia leite, Benjamin phin hae nynh mih khua hae kyate zunghe kyngpaw ccungccaw thong kuin lae taruh kha a suelua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />E rhawkaw hae balyn kyahin, voilang kuih a mangthya hae paw, popaw za sari a um hae; mih balyn mawte sangrua ccangkheit kha lung te asoo lei lan, phe tung lan a deihthya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin phin hobia leite, Israel hae nynh zunghe kyngpaw cciing pali kha a pum hae, mih balyn mawte rhawtuk a thya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Bethel lang thokute cceihthung hae zah Pachia kha, “Kaening kya hynh Benjamin phin tuk khylan hummou a cceih ty cih?” cite a khia hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Judah nynh a cceih ty cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae tuh awkhua takaw khe thokuh hae zah Gibeah khua pe khe a ryanua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Benjamin phin kha dou khylan a pou hae; Israel hae nynh rhawkaw hae kha Gibeah khua malang khe a nung hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae tuh Gibeah khua kyate oun pou hae zah, tuin nin kya Israel hae thong kuin lae ning kha a chia hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel hae tuh cceih hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe zete cia a rah hae; te minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Kae uno Benjamin phin hae kha dou khylan bua kae naenuakuh ung cih hae tou?” cite a khia hae. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ou, ccianua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel hae nynh mih rawthungsakuh hae zah, rhawkaw hae kha masaty nin lya a nungnaw hae hmin kyakhe bua a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nin ningnaw nin khe Israel hae nynh Benjamin phin hae kha a ccianua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Nin ningnaw nin khe Benjamin phin hae nynh minmin kha Gibeah khua kyate pounua hae zah, zunghe kyngpaw Israel hae thong haw lae tarya kha a chia hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel hae balyn, rhawkaw hae mih balynte Bethel lang ki hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang haungte a rah hae; tuin nin tuh zete cia looh-ae a sung hae. Te minmin nynh maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a rae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha khia hae zah (tuh ccyh lya tuh Pachia byakin thingkua tuh tuin kya um zah, <verse number="28" style="v" />Aaron ccapaw Eleazar a ccapaw Fineshas nynh tuh-e ccyh lya tuh a malang khe rya a law), “Kae uno Benjamin phin hae kha dou khylan vae kheit bua kae pou ung cih tou, tuhkhyhze kae umtaw vae cih tou?” a cipya hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Cceih oh, awkhualan minmin kha nae kuih kya kae pya cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae nynh Gibeah khua po voilu lan buhkhawtu hae kha aruh lante a nung hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh nin thumnaw nin khe Israel hae nynh Benjamin phin hae kha a ccianua hae, ninhyn hawte Gibeah khua pe khe rhawkaw hae kha a nungnua hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae nynh tuh-e rhawkaw hae kha pounua hae zah, khua kyate asawnaw lang cia a cceih hae. Ninhyn hawte rhawkaw hae kha a chia takaw hae; Bethel khua lang cceihpaw te Gibeah khua lang cceihpaw laanluepi hae kya thuasah, ramkaw kya thuasah Israel hae sung thum loukaw kha a chia hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae nynh, “Ninhyn hawte kae malang khe a shung hae,” cite a tua hae. Thuasalama Israel hae nynh, “Nulang sihkuh oh sih lah, minmin hynh khua te asawkunaw laanpi lang soih oh sih,” a ci hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel hae alunghua tuh nulang sihkuh hae zah Baal-tamar khua kyakhe a um hae, tuh ccyh lyakhe buhkhawtu Israel hae nynh Geba niccaw lang e mih umnaw kyakhate a pounua kangmaw hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Israel hae balyn kya-e popaw rhawkaw thong haw nynh Gebeah khua kha ccianua hae zah, thawte a tukkuh hae. Thuasalama Benjamin phin hae tuh ronaw nynh a naenuaku hae paw kha nykuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Benjamin kha Israel malang khe a tae; tuin nin khe Israel hae nynh zunghe kyngpaw Benjamin phin hae thong kuin lae pangaw za kheit kha a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tetuh Benjamin phin hae nynh kae shung vae cipaw a ny hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Israel hae tuh Benjamin phin hae malang te nulang a sihkuh hae, pawccecize Gibeah khua pe a nungnua hae paw buhkhawtu rhawkaw hae kha a doliaku hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Buhkhawtu rhawkaw hae nynh Gibeah khua kha vaekheihmawte thiing hae zah, khuapi kha thaloi te khaleih a chia hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel hae te buhkhawtu rhawkaw hae nynh syntawnaw hoi hae zah, khualae kya maeekhuh pipi he yn pou te, <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel hae tuh rhawtuknaw kalan bua ki lan, cite a hoku hae. Benjamin phin hae nynh Israel hae sung thum loukaw kha a chia takaw vae hae; minmin nynh, “Masaty rhawtuknaw kya hawte, minmin tuh kae malang a shung ccaccing cih hae,” cite a tua hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Maeekhuh pipi tuh khua kyate he yn khuhthung te, Benjamin phin hae nynh mih nulang he a do hae tuh, khua tuh abalynte maeekhuh lang vaawlang akhuhthung vae! <verse number="41" style="v" />Te Israel hae tuh nulang a ki hae, Benjamin phin hae tuh mih bungzou vae, pawccecize ronaw nynh oun naenuaku vae cipaw a ny hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae kyate maeleihkuh hae zah ramkaw langkhe a ccue hae; thuasalama rhawtuknaw nynh phah hae zah, khua kyate oun pou hae paw kha mih laku khe a chia mamin hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae kha koihlu biate Nohah khua kyate Gibeah khua nithua lang e hmin kyacia deehui hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae athungpaw rhawkaw hae thong haw lae tarya a chih hae. <verse number="45" style="v" />Maeleihkuh hae zah ramkaw lang Rimmon lungpi kalan a ccue lya hae khe, laanluepi hae kya milu thong pangaw a chia hae, te Gidom khua cia deehui hae zah milu thong ning kha mah a chia hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuin nin kya zunghe kyngpaw Benjamin phin athungpaw rhawkaw hae a chih hae paw tuh thong kuin lae pangaw acih hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Thuasalama milu za taruh tuh maekuh hae zah ramkaw lang Rimmon lungpi kalan a ccue hae, Rimmon lungpi kya sawpaw sah pali a um hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Benjamin phin hae kha kinua hae zah, khua lungkhu e ccungccaw hae, sahiin hae te a muih hae paw miakaw kha thaloi te a bae hae. A thuanua hae paw khua hae kha maee te a soi hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Benjamin Phin Ciihan Zosah Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Mizpah kyakhe, “Humhung nynh mah ah ccanung hae hynh Benjamin phin hae kalan tungtuhsah lei lan hae,” cite thyalawkute bya a kinku hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae tuh Bethel lang oun cceih hae zah Pachia malang khe zete cia haungte mih roisaw hae zah thawte a rah hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, pawccemou atunin hynh-e uccaw hynh yn um zah, Israel minphuin kya phin kheit tuh azo cih?” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Awkhualan khe ccungccaw hae tuh awkhua te tho hae zah, tuin kyakhe silawhang ccangkheit rae hae zah maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh, “Israel minphuin hae balyn kya-e ahummou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang pumkunaw kya thuabua khyh?” a ci hae. Pawccecize Mizpah khua lang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan athuabua leipaw ccungccaw te asekuh lante atynpaw byakinkunaw kha rae hae zah, “Tuh-e ccungccaw tuh chia athua cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh mih uno Benjamin phin kha ngaethyaumsah hae zah, “Israel hae kyate phin kheit tuh atunin vua athua vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aening nynh ah ccanung hae kha minmin kalan zu lang pya lei lan hae cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate thyalawkute bya ah kinku vae oh keiccuze, a hiinhy hae paw minmin hanlan zu hynh pawtemou cyipya lan hae?” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Israel phin hae kya Mizpah khua lang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a cceih leipaw hummou a um?” a ci hae. Jabesh-gilead khua kya-e lu kheit sanmah pumkunaw kalan ryahmin lang thuabua khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw hae kha he a ria hae tuh, tuin kya Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae lu kheit sanmah umbua khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze apumkuhpaw zapi hae nynh rhawkaw thong haw lae ning kha tuh-e khua lang saw hae zah, “La cceih oh lah, Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae kha nopi hae te imua hae ryte thaloi te la bae oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />E hynh na cyi lan oh paw athua cih; pise miakaw te pise ryte a ihkheih vae hae paw nopi miakaw kha khaleih na theih cih oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae kyakhe pise te a ihkheih boi lei hae paw liaccady za pali kha muih hae zah, Kanaan ram, Shiloh khua e ryahmin kalan khe a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te apumkuhpaw zapi hae nynh Rimmon lungpi kya um hae paw Benjamin phin hae kalan khe ccawkunaw bya kha a hosah pya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin ccyh khe Benjamin phin hae tuh oun ki hae zah, Israel hae nynh Jabesh-gilead khua e ahiinte a nung hae paw nopi hae kha zu lang a pya hae; thuasalama minmin hanlan zaw khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel phin hae mih lungngingnaw kha a ro keiccuze Israel hae nynh Benjamin phin kha ngaethya a umsah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze apumkuhpaw zapi hae kya-e piccan hae nynh, “Benjamin phin hae kya nopi hae a um vae khyh keiccuze a hiinhy hae paw hanlan zu tuh pawtemou cyipya lan hae?” a ci hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, “Israel phin hae kyate phin kheit kha azo khyh nawlan, Benjamin phin kya-e a hiinhy hae paw hanlan rho tuh a um aho. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhzemah ah ccanung hae kha zu lang minmin kha ah pya kho khyh oh,” a ci hae. Pawccecize Israel hae nynh thyalawkute byakinkuh hae zah, “Benjamin phin kha zu a pyapaw miakaw tuh thyalaw thua sah,” a ci hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh, “Dotua, Bethel thahlang, Bethel kyate Shekhem khua lang cceihpaw laanpi nithua lang, Lebonah khua alia lang umpaw Shiloh khua kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan kum takyh tuapaw poi tuh leih a um,” a ci hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae kha kawpya hae zah, “Cceih oh lah, misu khokhu hae kyakhe la buh oh lah, la dophi oh; <verse number="21" style="v" />Shiloh khua e liaccaw hae nynh lawnaw kya law khylan he oun pou hae te, misu khokhu kyate pounua oh lah, Shiloh khua e liaccaw hae kha mawmaw zu raveih lang kyngkuh oh, te Benjamin ram lang cceih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih paaw hae te mih raee hae nynh kae kya bya a lung hae ze, kaening nynh minmin kyakhe, ‘Thawccinawte beih hysah oh lah, beih oun pya oh; pawccecize rhawtuknaw kya minmin lu kheit cci hanlan zu kha kae kyngpah khyh hae. Nae ccanung hae kha minmin kalan na pya oh paw tuh seinaw na rae oh paw thua khyh,’ cite kae hopah cih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Benjamin hae nynh tuhcite a cyi hae; poi kya a law hae paw kya-e a kyng hae paw kha mih zu lang ccarou a lawku hae. Te cceih hae zah mih ram lang a ki hae, khua hae kha sakthui hae zah, tuin kya a um hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae tuh tuin nin khe mih phin te mih innbyn raveihte tuin kyate pou hae zah, mimaw ram lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh Israel hae kya siapharan um khyh; ccungccaw hae balyn nynh mih muihnaw kya akyh a ci hae paw kha a rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">Bpt 17.6</ref></char></note></para>
</usx>